 server refused the current request due to rate limiting. Please try again later.'=>'Server din Cloud ya ki amsa buƙatar da ake ciki saboda ƙuntatawa kan yawan amfani. Da fatan za a sake gwadawa daga baya.','Redetected node'=>'Nodi da aka sake ganowa','We are working hard to improve your online service experience. The service will be unavailable while we work. We apologize for any inconvenience.'=>'Muna aiki tukuru don inganta kwarewarku ta hidimar yanar gizo. Hidimar ba za ta kasance a aiki ba yayin da muke aiki. Muna ba da hakuri game da kowace irin matsala da hakan ka iya haifarwa.','Message from QUIC.cloud server'=>'Sakon daga uwar garken QUIC.cloud','Good news from QUIC.cloud server'=>'Albishiri daga uwar garken QUIC.cloud','%1$s plugin version %2$s required for this action.'=>'Ana buƙatar sigar %1$s ta plugin %2$s don aiwatar da wannan aikin.','Failed to communicate with QUIC.cloud server'=>'An kasa tattaunawa da uwar garken QUIC.cloud','Sync QUIC.cloud status successfully.'=>'An daidaita matsayin QUIC.cloud cikin nasara.','Sync credit allowance with Cloud Server successfully.'=>'An daidaita adadin biredi na bashi tare da Cloud Server cikin nasara.','Saving option failed. IPv4 only for %s.'=>'Ajiyar zaɓi ta gaza. IPv4 kaɗai don %s.','Changed setting successfully.'=>'An canza saiti cikin nasara.','Notified LiteSpeed Web Server to purge everything.'=>'An sanar da LiteSpeed Web Server don share komai.','Notified LiteSpeed Web Server to purge the list.'=>'An sanar da LiteSpeed Web Server don share jerin.','Sitemap cleaned successfully'=>'An cire Taswirar shafin cikin nasara','No valid sitemap parsed for crawler.'=>'Ba a binciko ingantaccen sitemap ba don mai rarrafe.','Sitemap created successfully: %d items'=>'An ƙirƙiri Taswirar Yanar Gizo cikin nasara: abubuwa %d','Crawler disabled list is cleared! All crawlers are set to active! '=>'An cire jerin abubuwan da aka hana masu bincike (crawler)! An saita duk masu bincike su zama masu aiki!','Started async crawling'=>'An fara jawo bayanan yanar gizo ba tare da jiran lokaci ba','Guest'=>'Baƙo','Manually added to blocklist'=>'An saka da hannu a cikin jerin abubuwan da aka katange','Previously existed in blocklist'=>'Ya kasance a cikin jerin wadanda aka katse a da','The database has been upgrading in the background since %s. This message will disappear once upgrade is complete.'=>'An riƙa haɓaka bayanan bayanai a bango tun daga %s. Wannan saƙon zai ɓace da zaran an gama haɓakawa.','Clean all successfully.'=>'Wanke duka cikin nasara.','Clean post revisions successfully.'=>'An cire tsoffin gyare-gyaren shafi cikin nasara.','Clean orphaned post meta successfully.'=>'An cire tsohuwar meta ta post da ta bace cikin nasara.','Clean auto drafts successfully.'=>'An cire abubuwan da aka adana ta atomatik cikin nasara.','Clean trashed posts and pages successfully.'=>'An cire gurabattattun wallafe-wallafe da shafuka cikin nasara.','Clean spam comments successfully.'=>'An share batattun sharhi cikin nasara.','Clean trashed comments successfully.'=>'An share sharaɗa da suka tafi cikin nasara.','Clean trackbacks and pingbacks successfully.'=>'An cire waƙoƙin baya da pingbacks da nasara.','Clean expired transients successfully.'=>'An tsaftace ɓangarorin da suka ƙare wa’adi cikin nasara.','Clean all transients successfully.'=>'An wanke dukkan abubuwan da suka wuce cikin nasara.','Optimized all tables.'=>'An inganta duk teburan.','Converted to InnoDB successfully.'=>'An canza zuwa InnoDB cikin nasara.','Invalid log type.'=>'Nau\'in shiga ba daidai ba ne.','Log file not found.'=>'Ba a sami fayil ɗin log ba.','This setting is %1$s for certain qualifying requests due to %2$s!'=>'Wannan saitin yana %1$s don wasu buƙatun da suka cancanta saboda %2$s!','This setting will regenerate crawler list and clear the disabled list!'=>'Wannan saitin zai sake ƙirƙirar jerin masu bincike (crawler) kuma zai share jerin da aka kashe!','This site utilizes caching in order to facilitate a faster response time and better user experience. Caching potentially stores a duplicate copy of every web page that is on display on this site. All cache files are temporary, and are never accessed by any third party, except as necessary to obtain technical support from the cache plugin vendor. Cache files expire on a schedule set by the site administrator, but may easily be purged by the admin before their natural expiration, if necessary. We may use QUIC.cloud services to process & cache your data temporarily.'=>'Wannan shafin yana amfani da fasahar ajiye bayanai na wucin gadi (caching) domin samar da saurin amsawa da ingantacciyar ƙwarewar mai amfani. Ajiye bayanai na wucin gadi na iya adana kwafin kowane shafin yanar gizo da ke nunawa a wannan shafin. Duk fayilolin ajiya na ɗan lokaci ne, kuma wani ɓangare na uku baya samun damar shiga su, sai dai idan ya zama dole don samun goyon bayan fasaha daga mai kawo sabis din. Fayilolin ajiyar suna karewa a cikin wani lokaci da mai gudanar da shafin ya tsara, amma mai gudanar da shafin zai iya goge su kafin lokacin karewarsu idan ya zama dole. Muna iya amfani da sabis na QUIC.cloud don sarrafawa da adana bayanan ku na ɗan lokaci.','Please see %s for more details.'=>'Da fat za a duba %s don samun ƙarin bayani.','Learn More'=>'Kara koyo','Both full and partial strings can be used.'=>'Ana iya amfani da cikakkun sassa da kuma gajerun sassa.','Both full URLs and partial strings can be used.'=>'Ana iya amfani da cikakkun adiresoshin URL da ɓangarorin haruffa.','This setting will edit the .htaccess file.'=>'Wannan saitin zai gyara fayil ɗin .htaccess.','The queue is processed asynchronously. It may take time.'=>'Ana sarrafa jerin a bayane. Yana iya ɗaukar lokaci.','This feature needs an online generation service, which is not included in this plugin. The setting has no effect.'=>'Wannan fasalin yana buƙatar sabis na tsarawa a kan intanet, wanda ba a haɗa shi cikin wannan plugin ɗin ba. Saitin ba shi da wani tasiri.','You have used all of your daily quota for today.'=>'Kun yi amfani da dukan kaso na yau don yau.','Learn more or purchase additional quota.'=>'Ƙara koyo ko sayen ƙarin kaso.','You have used all of your quota left for current service this month.'=>'Kun yi amfani da dukkan adadin rabo da ya rage muku na hidimar yanzu a wannan wata.','You have too many requested images, please try again in a few minutes.'=>'Kana da hotunan da suka yi yawa da aka nema, don Allah a sake gwadawa bayan \'yan mintoci kaɗan.','You have images waiting to be pulled. Please wait for the automatic pull to complete, or pull them down manually now.'=>'Kuna da hotunan da ke jiran a jawo su. Da fatan za a jira jawo na atomatik ya kammala, ko kuma ku jawo su da kanku yanzu.','The image list is empty.'=>'Jerin hotunan ba shi da komai.','Not enough parameters. Please check if the QUIC.cloud connection is set correctly'=>'Ba a da ma\'aikata wadanda suka isa. Da fatan za a duba ko an saita haɗin QUIC.cloud da daidai','There is proceeding queue not pulled yet.'=>'Akwai jerin gwano da ke ci gaba wanda ba a ja ba tukuna.','There is proceeding queue not pulled yet. Queue info: %s.'=>'Akwai layin aiwatarwa da ba a jawo shi ba tukuna. Bayanin layi: %s.','The site is not a valid alias on QUIC.cloud.'=>'Shafin ba ingantaccen lafazi ba ne akan QUIC.cloud.','The site is not registered on QUIC.cloud.'=>'Ba a yi rijistar shafin ba a kan QUIC.cloud.','The QUIC.cloud connection is not correct. Please try to sync your QUIC.cloud connection again.'=>'Haɗin QUIC.cloud bai daidaita ba. Da fatan za a sake gwada daidaita haɗin QUIC.cloud ɗinka.','The current server is under heavy load.'=>'Server na yanzu yana fuskantar nauyi mai yawa.','Online node needs to be redetected.'=>'Ana buƙatar sake gano yanar gizon da ke kan layi.','Credits are not enough to proceed the current request.'=>'Ba a da kiredit da ya isa don ci gaba da buƙatar yanzu.','%s file not writable.'=>'Ba a iya rubuta fayil din %s ba.','Could not find %1$s in %2$s.'=>'Ba a iya samun %1$s a cikin %2$s ba.','Invalid login cookie. Please check the %s file.'=>'Cookie din shiga ba daidai ba ne. Da fatan za a bincika fayil ɗin %s.','Failed to back up %s file, aborted changes.'=>'An kasaaji ajiyewa %s fayil, an soke canje-canjen.','%s file not readable.'=>'Ba a iya karanta fayil din %s ba.','Failed to get %s file contents.'=>'An kasa samun abubuwan da ke cikin fayil ɗin %s.','Failed to create table %1$s! SQL: %2$s.'=>'An gaza ƙirƙirar teburin %1$s! SQL: %2$s.','Crawler disabled by the server admin.'=>'Mai gudanar da sabar ya kashe mai binciken yanar gizo (crawler).','Previous request too recent. Please try again later.'=>'An roƙon da aka gabata ya yi kusa sosai. Don Allah a sake gwadawa daga baya.','Previous request too recent. Please try again after %s.'=>'An roƙo da yawa kwanan nan. Da fatan za a sake gwadawa bayan %s.','Your application is waiting for approval.'=>'Ana jiran amincewa da aikace-kawenku.','The callback validation to your domain failed due to hash mismatch.'=>'Tabbacin callback zuwa ga domain ɗinka ya gaza saboda rashin dacewar hash.','The callback validation to your domain failed. Please make sure there is no firewall blocking our servers.'=>'Tabbatar da kiran da aka yi zuwa yankinka (domain) ya gaza. Don Allah a tabbatar cewa babu wani bango mai kare na\'ura (firewall) da ke tare da sabar mu.','The callback validation to your domain failed. Please make sure there is no firewall blocking our servers. Response code: '=>'Kuskure ya faru yayin tabbatar da kira zuwa ga yankinka. Da fatan za a tabbatar babu wani firewall da ke Ƙuntata sabar namu. Lambar martani:','Your domain has been forbidden from using our services due to a previous policy violation.'=>'An hana yankin ku amfani da sabis ɗinmu saboda wani sabon take doka da aka yi a baya.','You cannot remove this DNS zone, because it is still in use. Please update the domain\'s nameservers, then try to delete this zone again, otherwise your site will become inaccessible.'=>'Ba za ka iya cire wannan yanki na