5.'=>'Md5 na hoton WebP da aka ja bai dace da md5 na hoton WebP da aka sanar ba.','Pulled AVIF image md5 does not match the notified AVIF image md5.'=>'Hoton AVIF da aka janye md5 bai yi daidai da md5 na hoton AVIF da aka sanar ba.','One or more pulled images does not match with the notified image md5'=>'Ɗaya ko fiye da hotunan da aka ɗauko ba su dace da md5 na hoton da aka sanar ba','Pushed %1$s to Cloud server, accepted %2$s.'=>'An tura %1$s zuwa sabar Cloud, an karɓi %2$s.','Cleared %1$s invalid images.'=>'An share %1$s hotunan da ba su da inganci.','No valid image found in the current request.'=>'Ba a samoni ingantacciyar hoto a cikin roƙon da ake ciki yanzu ba.','No valid image found by Cloud server in the current request.'=>'Ba a sami ingantacciyar hoto ta uwar garken Cloud a cikin buƙatar yanzu ba.','Import failed due to file error.'=>'Shigo da kaya ya gaza saboda kuskuren fayil.','Imported setting file %s successfully.'=>'An nasarar shigo da fayil din saitunan %s.','Reset successfully.'=>'An sake saita ta cikin nasara.','Images not requested'=>'Ba a nemi hotuna ba','Images ready to request'=>'Hotunan da aka shirya don buƙatu','Images requested'=>'Hotunan da aka nema','Images notified to pull'=>'Hotunan da aka sanar don jawowa','Images optimized and pulled'=>'An inganta hotuna kuma an samo su','Unable to automatically add %1$s as a Domain Alias for main %2$s domain, due to potential CDN conflict.'=>'Ba zai yiwu a ƙara %1$s ta atomatik a matsayin Laƙabin Domain don babban domain %2$s ba, saboda yiwuwar rikicin CDN.','Unable to automatically add %1$s as a Domain Alias for main %2$s domain.'=>'Ba a iya ƙara %1$s ta atomatik a matsayin Laƙabin Domain don babban domain %2$s ba.','Alias is in use by another QUIC.cloud account.'=>'Wani QUIC.cloud account na amfani da wannan Alias.','Enable Cache'=>'Kunna Cache','Browser Cache'=>'Ma\'ajiyar Browser','Default Public Cache TTL'=>'Tsohuwar Ma\'ajiyar Jama\'a ta TTL','Default Private Cache TTL'=>'Tsohuwar Cache TTL ta Ke