fy'=>'Sauƙaƙe CSS','CSS Combine'=>'Haɗa CSS','CSS Combine External and Inline'=>'Haɗa CSS na Waje da Na Ciki','Generate UCSS'=>'Ƙirƙiri UCSS','UCSS Inline'=>'UCSS Inline','UCSS Selector Allowlist'=>'Jerin zababbun abubuwan da aka yarda na UCSS Selector','UCSS Inline Excluded Files'=>'Fayilolin da aka cire na UCSS Inline','UCSS URI Excludes'=>'Waje da aka kebe daga UCSS URI','JS Minify'=>'Tace JS','JS Combine'=>'Haɗa JS','JS Combine External and Inline'=>'Haɗa JS na Waje da Ciki','HTML Minify'=>'Tace HTML','HTML Lazy Load Selectors'=>'Zaɓuɓɓukan Saukar da HTML Ta Shaci Farko','HTML Keep Comments'=>'Riƙe Sharhin HTML','Load CSS Asynchronously'=>'Loda CSS ta Hanyar Saurinta','CCSS Per URL'=>'CCSS a kowane URL','Inline CSS Async Lib'=>'Laburare na CSS Async na Cikin Layi','Font Display Optimization'=>'Haɓaka Nuni da Font','Load JS Deferred'=>'Sanya JS ya Jinkiri','Localize Resources'=>'Sanya Kayayyaki a Harshen Gida','Localization Files'=>'Fayilolin Harshe','DNS Prefetch'=>'DNS Prefetch','DNS Prefetch Control'=>'Sarrafa Tsinkayen DNS','DNS Preconnect'=>'DNS Preconnect','CSS Excludes'=>'Keɓancewar CSS','JS Delayed Includes'=>'Jinkirta Haɗa JS','JS Excludes'=>'Keɓewar JS','Remove Query Strings'=>'Cire Maɓallin Tambaya','Load Google Fonts Asynchronously'=>'Loda Fonts na Google A Hanya ta Hanyar Asynchronous','Remove Google Fonts'=>'Cire Google Fonts','Critical CSS Rules'=>'Dokoki masu muhimmanci na CSS','Separate CCSS Cache Post Types'=>'Raba Nau\'ikan Sakon CCSS Cache','Separate CCSS Cache URIs'=>'Rabewar Wuraren Ajiye Na CCSS','CCSS Selector Allowlist'=>'Jerin abubuwan da aka yarda na CCSS Selector','JS Deferred / Delayed Excludes'=>'Keɓancewar JS da aka Jinkirta / Jinkirtawa','Guest Mode JS Excludes'=>'Kebɓantattun JavaScript na Hanyar Baƙo','Remove WordPress Emoji'=>'Cire WordPress Emoji','Remove Noscript Tags'=>'Cire Alamomin Noscript','URI Excludes'=>'Abubuwan da aka keɓe na URI','Optimize for Guests Only'=>'Inganta Don Baƙi Kaɗai','Role Excludes'=>'Matsayin da aka c