in Bar'=>'Admin ɗin Cache Bar','Cache Comment Form'=>'Adana Formin Sharhi','ESI Nonces'=>'ESI Nonces','Vary Group'=>'Rukunin Vary','Purge All Hooks'=>'Share Duk Abubuwan Haɗin','Improve HTTP/HTTPS Compatibility'=>'Inganta Jituwa ta HTTP/HTTPS','Instant Click'=>'Danna Nan Take','Do Not Cache Cookies'=>'Kada Ka Ajiye Kukis','Do Not Cache User Agents'=>'Kada Ka Rungumo Wakilan Mai Amfani','Login Cookie'=>'Kogin Shiga','Vary Cookies'=>'Canja Kukis','Frontend Heartbeat Control'=>'Kulawar Zuciyar Frontend','Frontend Heartbeat TTL'=>'Lokacin Tsayayyar Frontend Heartbeat TTL','Backend Heartbeat Control'=>'Kulawar Zuciya ta Backend','Backend Heartbeat TTL'=>'Lokacin Gudu na Backend Heartbeat','Editor Heartbeat'=>'Bugun Edita','Editor Heartbeat TTL'=>'Tsawon Lokacin Heartbeat na Ma\'edita (TTL)','Use CDN Mapping'=>'Yi Amfani da Taswirar CDN','CDN URL'=>'Adreshin CDN','Include Images'=>'Haɗa Hotuna','Include CSS'=>'Haɗa CSS','Include JS'=>'Haɗa JS','Include File Types'=>'Haɗa Nau\'ikan Fayiloli','HTML Attribute To Replace'=>'Halayen HTML da za a Sauya','Original URLs'=>'Asalin URLs','Included Directories'=>'Kundaye da aka haɗa','Exclude Path'=>'Cire Hanyar','Cloudflare API'=>'Cloudflare API','Clear Cloudflare cache'=>'Goge cache na Cloudflare','Crawl Interval'=>'Lokacin Shiga Yanar Gizo','Server Load Limit'=>'Iyakacin Nauyin Sabar','Role Simulation'=>'Simintin Matsayi','Cookie Simulation'=>'Kwaikwayon Cookie','Custom Sitemap'=>'Taswirar Shafuka ta Musamman','Disable All Features'=>'Kashe Duk Wasu Siffofi','Debug Log'=>'Gwangwayar Diloli Ta Binciken Kuskure','Admin IPs'=>'IPs na Admin','Debug Level'=>'Matsayin Dubawa','Log File Size Limit'=>'Iyakar Girman Fayil ɗin Shiga','Collapse Query Strings'=>'Rushe Tambayoyin Tambaya','Debug URI Includes'=>'Ya ƙunshi URI na Debug','Debug URI Excludes'=>'Keɓance URI na Cire Kuskure','Debug String Excludes'=>'Keɓance Tsarin Gyara Kuskure','Revisions Max Number'=>'Matsakaicin adadin gyare-gyare','Revisions Max Age'=>'Matsakaicin Shekarun Sake Dubawa','Batch rescale completed.'=>'An kammala sake girka rukuni.','LiteSpeed Optimization'=>'Haɓaka LiteSpeed','(optm)'=>'(optm)','Currently using optimized version of file.'=>'Ana amfani da ingantaccen sigar fayil din a halin yanzu.','Click to switch to original (unoptimized) version.'=>'Danna don canzawa zuwa sigar asali (wacce ba a inganta ba).','(non-optm)'=>'(ba a inganta ba)','Currently using original (unoptimized) version of file.'=>'A halin yanzu ana amfani da ainihin sigar fayil (ba a inganta shi ba).','Click to switch to optimized version.'=>'Danna domin sauyawa zuwa sigar da aka inganta.','Original file reduced by %1$s (%2$s)'=>'An rage girman asalin fayil ɗin da %1$s (%2$s)','Orig saved %s'=>'An adana a asali %s','Using optimized version of file. '=>'Ana amfani da ingantaccen sigar fayil din.','No backup of original file exists.'=>'Babu madadin ajiyar asalin fayil ɗin.','Congratulation! Your file was already optimized'=>'Taya murna! An riga an inganta fayil ɗinka','Orig %s'=>'Asali %s','(no savings)'=>'(babu tanadi)','Orig'=>'Asali','Currently using optimized version of AVIF file.'=>'A halin yanzu ana amfani da ingantaccen sigar fayil din AVIF.','Currently using optimized version of WebP file.'=>'A halin yanzu ana amfani da ingantaccen sigar fayil din WebP.','Currently using original (unoptimized) version of AVIF file.'=>'A halin yanzu ana amfani da ainihin sigar (wacce ba a inganta ta ba) ta fayil din AVIF.','Currently using original (unoptimized) version of WebP file.'=>'Ana amfani da asalin sigar (wacce ba a inganta ba) ta fayil din WebP a halin yanzu.','AVIF file reduced by %1$s (%2$s)'=>'An rage girman fayil ɗin AVIF da %1$s (%2$s)','WebP file reduced by %1$s (%2$s)'=>'An rage girman fayil ɗin WebP da %1$s (%2$s)','AVIF saved %s'=>'An adana AVIF %s','WebP saved %s'=>'An adana WebP %s','No backup of unoptimized AVIF file exists.'=>'Babu ajiyar fayil ɗin AVIF da ba a inganta ba.','No backup of unoptimized WebP file exists.'=>'Babu kwafin madadin fayil din WebP da ba a inganta ba.','Restore from backup'=>'Mayar da daga madadin ajiyar bayanai','Disable Cache'=>'Kashe Cache','Disable Image Lazyload'=>'Kashe Loadin Hotuna na Gaggawa','Disable VPI'=>'Kashe VPI','Mobile'=>'Wayar hannു','Redis encountered a fatal error: %1$s (code: %2$d)'=>'Redis ta fuskanci babban kuskure: %1$s (lamba: %2$d)','LQIP'=>'LQIP','LQIP image preview for size %s'=>'Hoton samfoti na LQIP don girman %s','Purged all caches successfully.'=>'An cire duk wasu cache cikin nasara.','Notified LiteSpeed Web Server to purge all LSCache entries.'=>'An sanar da LiteSpeed Web Server don share duk abubuwan shigarwa na LSCache.','Cleaned all Critical CSS files.'=>'An wanke duk fayilolin CSS masu mahimmanci.','Cleaned all Unique CSS files.'=>'An tsaftace duk fayilolin CSS na Musamman.','Cleaned all LQIP files.'=>'An wanke duk fayilolin LQIP.','Cleaned all VPI data.'=>'An goge duk bayanan VPI.','Cleaned all Gravatar files.'=>'An share dukkan fayilolin Gravatar.','Cleaned all localized resource entries.'=>'An wanke dukkan abubuwan da aka fassara.','Notified LiteSpeed Web Server to purge CSS/JS entries.'=>'An sanar da LiteSpeed Web Server don share abubuwan da suka shafi CSS/JS.','OPcache is not enabled.'=>'Ba a kunna OPcache ba.','OPcache is restricted by %s setting.'=>'An takaita OPcache ta hanyar saitin %s.','Reset the OPcache failed.'=>'Sake saita OPcache ta gaza.','Reset the entire OPcache successfully.'=>'An sake saita dukan OPcache cikin nasara.','Object cache is not enabled.'=>'Ba a kunna ma\'ajiyar abu ba.','Purge all object caches successfully.'=>'An share dukkan ma\'ajiyar abubuwa cikin nasara.','Notified LiteSpeed Web Server to purge the front page.'=>'An sanar da LiteSpeed Web Server don share shafin farko.','Notified LiteSpeed Web Server to purge all pages.'=>'An sanar da LiteSpeed Web Server don share duk shafuka.','Notified LiteSpeed Web Server to purge error pages.'=>'An sanar wa LiteSpeed Web Server don share shafukan kuskure.','Purge category %s'=>'Share rutacci %s','Purge tag %s'=>'Goge alama %s','Purge url %s'=>'Share url %s tsabtacewa','All QUIC.cloud service queues have been cleared.'=>'An cire duk layukan sabis na QUIC.cloud.','Every 15 Minutes'=>'Kowane Minti 15','LiteSpeed Crawler Cron'=>'LiteSpeed Crawler Cron','Failed to detect IP'=>'An gaza gano IP','right now'=>'a yanzu haka','just now'=>'yanzu-yanzu',' %s ago'=>'%s da suka wuce','Please consider disabling the following detected plugins, as they may conflict with Zinn® Cache Engine:'=>'Da fat za a yi la\'akari da kashe wadannan manhajoji da aka gano, domin suna iya samun sabani da Zinn® Cache Engine:','WooCommerce Settings'=>'Saitunan WooCommerce','NOTICE:'=>'SANARWA:','After verifying that the cache works in general, please test the cart.'=>'Bayan an tabbatar da cewa cache yana aiki gaba ɗaya, da fatan za a gwada keken siyayya.','To test the cart, visit the %sFAQ%s.'=>'Don gwada keken siyayya, ziyarci %sFAQ%s.','By default, the My Account, Checkout, and Cart pages are automatically excluded from caching. Misconfiguration of page associations in WooCommerce settings may cause some pages to be erroneously excluded.'=>'Ta tsohuwa, shafukan My Account, Checkout, da Cart ana cire su daga adana bayanai ta atomatik. Rashin daidaita haɗin shafuka a cikin saitunan WooCommerce na iya sa a cire wasu shafuka bisa kuskure.','Product Update Interval'=>'Lokacin Sabunta Samfur','Purge product on changes to the quantity or stock status.'=>'Goge samfurin kan sauye-sauye ga yawa ko matsayin kaya.','Purge categories only when stock status changes.'=>'Shafe nau\'ikan kawai lokacin da matsayin kaya ya canza.','Purge product and categories only when the stock status changes.'=>'Share kayayyaki da rukunoni kawai lokacin da matsayin kayan ajiya ya canza.','Purge product only when the stock status changes.'=>'Tace samfurin kawai lokacin da yanayin kaya ya canza.','Do not purge categories on changes to the quantity or stock status.'=>'Kar a share rukunai kan canje-canje a adadi ko matsayin kayan da ke cikin kaya.','Always purge both product and categories on changes to the quantity or stock status.'=>'Kowane lokaci a goge kayayyaki da rukunoni lokacin da aka yi canji ga adadi ko matsayin kaya.','Determines how changes in product quantity and product stock status affect product pages and their associated category pages.'=>'Yana ƙayyade yadda sauye-sauye a yawan kaya da matsayin kayayyaki a cikin shago ke shafar shafukan kayayyaki da shafukan rukunansu masu alaƙa.','Vary for Mini Cart'=>'Canji don Ƙaramin Keken Siyayya','Generate a separate vary cache copy for the mini cart when the cart is not empty.'=>'Haifar da kwafin cache na dabam don ƙaramin keken abinci lokacin da keken abinci ba ya da komai.','If your theme does not use JS to update the mini cart, you must enable this option to display the correct cart contents.'=>'Idan jigonka baya amfani da JS don sabunta karamin kwandon kaya, dole ne ka kunna wannan zabin don nuna abubuwan da ke cikin kwandon da suka dace.','New Developer Version Available!'=>'Akwai Sabon Sigar Mai Ƙirƙira!','New developer version %s is available now.'=>'Akwai sabon sigar mai haɓakawa %s yanzu.','Upgrade'=>'Haɓaka','Purge'=>'Sharewa','Excludes'=>'Ba ya ciki','Object'=>'Abu','Browser'=>'Bincike','Advanced'=>'Na gaba da hanci','Zinn® Cache Engine Network Cache Settings'=>'Saitunan Ma\'ajiyar Zinn® Cache Engine Network','TTL'=>'TTL','ESI'=>'ESI','Zinn® Cache Engine Settings'=>'Saitunan Injinin Zinn® Cache','NOTE'=>'LURA','More settings available under %s menu'=>'Ana samun kararin saituna a karkashin menu na %s','Advanced Settings'=>'Saitunan Ci gaba','Cache Control Settings'=>'Saitunan Kula da Cache','Network Enable Cache'=>'Kunna Kafar Sadarwa ta Cache','Enabling Zinn® Cache Engine for WordPress here enables the cache for the network.'=>'Kunna Zinn® Cache Engine don WordPress a nan yana kunna cache don hanyar sadarwa.','It is STRONGLY recommended that the compatibility with other plugins on a single/few sites is tested first.'=>'Ana BAURAN bada shawarar cewa a fara gwada dacewar tare da wasu "plugins" a kan guda daya ko ‘yan shafuka kadan tukuna.','This is to ensure compatibility prior to enabling the cache for all sites.'=>'Wannan domin tabbatar da jituwa ne kafin a kunna ajiyar wucin gadi don duk shafuka.','Exclude Settings'=>'Cire Saituttuka','Purge Settings'=>'Saitunan share fage','These settings are meant for ADVANCED USERS ONLY.'=>'Waɗannan saitunan na masu amfani da su suka ƘWARE SOSAI ne kawai.','Specify an AJAX action in POST/GET and the number of seconds to cache that request, separated by a space.'=>'Faɗi wani aikin AJAX a cikin POST/GET da adadin daƙiƙoƙin adana wannan buƙatar a cache, wanda aka raba da tazara.','Enable this option if you are using both HTTP and HTTPS in the same domain and are noticing cache irregularities.'=>'Kunna wannan zaɓin idan kana amfani da HTTP da HTTPS a lokaci guda a cikin yanki ɗaya kuma kana lura da matsalolin cache.','When a visitor hovers over a page link, preload that page. This will speed up the visit to that link.'=>'Idan mai ziyara ya sanya linzamin kwamfuta a kan hanyar shafi, a loda shafin a gaba. Wannan zai sa ziyartar wannan hanyar ta yi sauri.','This will generate extra requests to the server, which will increase server load.'=>'Wannan zai haifar da ƙarin buƙatu zuwa ga uwar garken, wanda hakan zai ƙara nauyi a kan uwar garken.','Use Network Admin Setting'=>'Yi Amfani da Saitin Mai Gudanar da Sadarwa','Please visit the %sInformation%s page on how to test the cache.'=>'Da fat za a ziyarci shafin %sInformation%s don samun bayani kan yadda za a gwada ajiyar cache.','NOTICE'=>'SANARWA','When disabling the cache, all cached entries for this site will be purged.'=>'Lokacin da aka kashe cache din, za a share dukkan bayanan da aka adana na wannan shafin.','The network admin setting can be overridden here.'=>'Ana iya wuce saitin mai kula da hanyar sadarwa a nan.','Privately cache frontend pages for logged-in users. (LSWS %s required)'=>'Ajiye shafukan gaba na gida a sirri ga masu amfani da suka shiga. (Ana buƙatar LSWS %s)','Privately cache commenters that have pending comments. Disabling this option will serve non-cacheable pages to commenters. (LSWS %s required)'=>'Yi caching na masu tsokaci waɗanda ke da tsokaci masu jiran amincewa a sirrِce. Kashe wannan zaɓi zai ba da shafukan da ba za a iya yin caching nasu ba ga masu tsokaci. (Ana buƙatar LSWS %s)','Cache requests made by WordPress REST API calls.'=>'Ajiye buƙatun da aka yi ta hanyar kiran WordPress REST API a cikin cache.','Disabling this option may negatively affect performance.'=>'Kashe wannan zaɓi na iya shafar aiki mara kyau.','URI Paths containing these strings will NOT be cached as public.'=>'Hanyoyin URI da ke dauke da waɗannan kirtani ba za a adana su a matsayin na jama\'a ba.','Paths containing these strings will be cached regardless of no-cacheable settings.'=>'Za a adana hanyoyin da ke dauke da waɗannan kirtani a rumbun ajiya (cache) ba tare da la\'akari da saitunan rashin iya adanawa ba.','To define a custom TTL for a URI, add a space followed by the TTL value to the end of the URI.'=>'Don bayyana keɓantaccen TTL ga URI, ƙara sarari sannan ƙimar TTL a ƙarshen URI.','For example, %1$s defines a TTL of %2$s seconds for %3$s.'=>'Misali, %1$s yana bayyana TTL na daƙiƙa %2$s don %3$s.','Paths containing these strings will be forced to public cached regardless of no-cacheable settings.'=>'Za a tilasta wa hanyoyin da ke dauke da wadannan zaruruwa su zama na jama\'a da aka adana a madigo ba tare da la\'akari da ka\'idojin rashin adanawa ba.','ESI Settings'=>'Saitunan ESI','With ESI (Edge Side Includes), pages may be served from cache for logged-in users.'=>'Tare da ESI (Edge Side Includes), ana iya ba da shafuka daga rumbun adana bayanai (cache) ga masu amfani da suka shiga shafin.','ESI allows you to designate parts of your dynamic page as separate fragments that are then assembled together to make the whole page. In other words, ESI lets you “punch holes” in a page, and then fill those holes with content that may be cached privately, cached publicly with its own TTL, or not cached at all.'=>'ESI tana ba ku damar tsara sassan shafin ku mai amfani da hanyoyi daban-daban a matsayin guntattun sassa daban-daban waɗannan da aka haɗa tare don yin gabaɗayan shafin. A wata kalmar, ESI tana ba ku damar “huda rami” a cikin shafin, sannan ku cika waɗannan ramukan da abubuwan da za a iya adana su a asirce, adana su a fili tare da nasu TTL, ko kuma kada a adana su ko kaɗan.','WpW: Private Cache vs. Public Cache'=>'WpW: Private Cache da Public Cache','You can turn shortcodes into ESI blocks.'=>'Kuna iya juya gajerun lambobi zuwa tubalan ESI.','Replace %1$s with %2$s.'=>'Maye gurbin %1$s da %2$s.','ESI sample for developers'=>'Samfurin ESI ga masu haɓaka software','WARNING'=>'GARGADI','These options are only available with LiteSpeed Enterprise Web Server.'=>'Waɗannan zaɓuɓɓuka suna samuwa ne kawai tare da LiteSpeed Enterprise Web Server.','Turn ON to cache public pages for logged in users, and serve the Admin Bar and Comment Form via ESI blocks. These two blocks will be uncached unless enabled below.'=>'Kunna don adana shafukan jama\'a a cikin cache ga masu amfani da suka shiga, kuma ku ba da Admin Bar da Comment Form ta hanyar tubalan ESI. Waɗannan tubalan guda biyu ba za su kasance a cikin cache ba sai dai idan an kunna su a ƙasa.','Cache the built-in Admin Bar ESI block.'=>'Adana ƙundumiyar shigar da aka gina ta Admin Bar ESI.','Cache the built-in Comment Form ESI block.'=>'Ajiye sashin ESI na Form ɗin Sharhi da aka gina a ciki cikin cache.','The list will be merged with the predefined nonces in your local data file.'=>'Za a haɗa jerin tare da ƙayyadaddun nonces da aka riga aka bayyana a cikin fayil ɗin bayanai na gida.','The latest data file is'=>'Fayil na bayanai na karshe shine','Filter %s is supported.'=>'An tace %s yana da tallafi.','The above nonces will be converted to ESI automatically.'=>'Za a juya nonces ɗin da ke sama zuwa ESI ta atomatik.','An optional second parameter may be used to specify cache control. Use a space to separate'=>'Ana iya amfani da wani sigina na biyu na zaɓi don ƙayyadawa ikon taskewa. Yi amfani da tazara don rabuwa','Wildcard %1$s supported (match zero or more characters). For example, to match %2$s and %3$s, use %4$s.'=>'Ana goyon bayan Wildcard %1$s (yana dacewa da sifili ko fiye da haruffa). Misali, don dacewa da %2$s da %3$s, yi amfani da %4$s.','If your site contains public content that certain user roles can see but other roles cannot, you can specify a Vary Group for those user roles. For example, specifying an administrator vary group allows there to be a separate publicly-cached page tailored to administrators (with “edit” links, etc), while all other user roles see the default public page.'=>'Idan shafinka ya ƙunshi abubuwan da ke bayyane a fili waɗanda takamaiman matsayin masu amfani za su iya gani amma wasu matsayin ba za su iya gani ba, za ka iya bayyana Rukunin Bambanci (Vary Group) don waɗannan matsayin masu amfani. Misali, bayyana rukunin bambanci na mai gudanarwa yana ba da damar samun keɓaɓɓen shafi da aka adana a fili wanda aka keɓance ga masu gudanarwa (tare da hanyoyin haɗi na "gyara", da saur മറ്റ്), yayin da duk sauran matsayin masu amfani ke ganin tsohon shafin jama\'a.','Paths containing these strings will not be cached.'=>'Hanyoyin da ke dauke da waɗannan kirtani ba za a adana su a cikin ma\'ajiyar wucin gadi ba.','Predefined list will also be combined w/ the above settings'=>'Za a haɗa maɓuɓɓugar da aka riga aka tsara tare da saitunan da ke sama','Query strings containing these parameters will not be cached.'=>'Ba za a adana ma\'ajiyar gida (cache) ga tambayoyin da ke dauke da wadannan sigogi ba.','For example, for %1$s, %2$s and %3$s can be used here.'=>'Misali, don %1$s, ana iya amfani da %2$s da %3$s a nan.','All categories are cached by default.'=>'Ana adana dukkan nau\'ikan a cikin madogarar gida ta tsohuwa.','To prevent %s from being cached, enter them here.'=>'Sanya su a nan don hana %s daga adanawa a cache.','categories'=>'nau\'uka','If the category name is not found, the category will be removed from the list on save.'=>'Idan ba a sami sunan rukunin ba, za a cire rukunin daga jerin lokacin da aka Ajiye.','All tags are cached by default.'=>'Ana adana duk alamomi a cikin ma\'ajiyar wucin gadi ta tsohuwa.','tags'=>'shafi','If the tag slug is not found, the tag will be removed from the list on save.'=>'Idan ba a samo gajeriyar alamar ba, za a cire alamar daga cikin lissafin lokacin da aka adana.','To exclude %1$s, insert %2$s.'=>'Don cire %1$s, saka %2$s.','Selected roles will be excluded from cache.'=>'Za a cire zababbun matsayi daga cikin cache.','All pages'=>'Shafuka duka','Front page'=>'Shafina na gaba','Home page'=>'Shafin gida','Pages'=>'Shafuka','All pages with Recent Posts Widget'=>'Dukkan shafuka masu Widget na Rubuce-Rubuce na Kwanan Nan','Author archive'=>'Taron marubuta','Post type archive'=>'Ma\'ajiyar nau\'in rubutu','Yearly archive'=>'Tarihin shekara-shekara','Monthly archive'=>'Tarihin wata-wata','Daily archive'=>'Taron yau da kullum','Term archive (include category, tag, and tax)'=>'Tarin sharuɗɗa (ya haɗa da rukuni, alama, da haraji)','Auto Purge Rules For Publish/Update'=>'Dokokin Share Fage Kai Tsaye Lokacin Bugawa/Sabuntawa','Note'=>'Lura','Select "All" if there are dynamic widgets linked to posts on pages other than the front or home pages.'=>'Zaɓi "All" idan akwai abubuwan sakawa masu kuzari da ke da alaƙa da posts a shafuka banda gaban gida ko shafukan gida.','Other checkboxes will be ignored.'=>'Za a yi watsi da sauran akwatunan zaɓe.','Select only the archive types that are currently used, the others can be left unchecked.'=>'Zaɓi nau\'ikan taskoki kawai waɗanda ake amfani da su a halin yanzu, sauran za a iya barin su ba tare da an saka alama ba.','Select which pages will be automatically purged when posts are published/updated.'=>'Zaɓi shafukan da za a share ta atomatik lokacin da aka wallafa/sabunta rubuce-rubuce.','If ON, the stale copy of a cached page will be shown to visitors until a new cache copy is available. Reduces the server load for following visits. If OFF, the page will be dynamically generated while visitors wait.'=>'Idan yana KUNNE, za a nuna tsohuwar kwafin shafin da aka adana ga baƙi har sai sabon kwafin da aka adana ya kasance. Yana rage nauyin uwar garken don ziyarce-ziyarce masu zuwa. Idan KASHE, za a samar da shafin ta hanyar atomatik yayin da baƙi ke jira.','By design, this option may serve stale content. Do not enable this option, if that is not OK with you.'=>'Saboda yadda aka tsara shi, wannan zaɓin na iya nuna tsofaffin abubuwa. Kada ka kunna wannan zaɓin, idan hakan bai dace da kai ba.','The URLs here (one per line) will be purged automatically at the time set in the option "%s".'=>'Za a share URLs ɗin da ke nan (ɗaya a kowane layi) ta atomatik a lokacin da aka saita a cikin zaɓin "%s".','Both %1$s and %2$s are acceptable.'=>'Dukansu %1$s da %2$s abubuwa ne da za a iya karɓa.','For URLs with wildcards, there may be a delay in initiating scheduled purge.'=>'Ga URLs masu amfani da alamomin daji (wildcards), yana iya ɗaukar ɗan lokaci kafin a fara share abubuwan da aka tsara.','Specify the time to purge the "%s" list.'=>'Saka lokacin da za a share jerin "%s".','Current server time is %s.'=>'Lokacin sabar na yanzu shine %s.','A Purge All will be executed when WordPress runs these hooks.'=>'Za a aiwatar da tsaftace komai (Purge All) idan WordPress ta gudanar da waɗannan hulɗodin.','Specify how long, in seconds, public pages are cached.'=>'A ƙayyade tsawon lokacin, a cikin daƙiƙa, da ake adana shafukan jama\'a a ajiyar wucin gadi (cache).','Specify how long, in seconds, private pages are cached.'=>'Sanya tsawon lokaci, a cikin daƙiƙa, da ake adana shafukan sirri a ma\'ajiyar ɗan lokaci.','Specify how long, in seconds, the front page is cached.'=>'Ƙayyade tsawon lokacin, a cikin daƙiƙa, da ake ajiye shafin farko a cikin gajiyar wucin gadi.','Specify how long, in seconds, feeds are cached.'=>'Ƙayyade tsawon lokacin, a cikin daƙiƙa, da ake ajiye ciyarwa (feeds) a cikin ma\'ajiyar ɗan lokaci.','If this is set to a number less than 30, feeds will not be cached.'=>'Idan an saita wannan zuwa lamba da ta kasa 30, ba za a adana ciyarwar ba.','Specify how long, in seconds, REST calls are cached.'=>'Sanya tsawon lokaci, a cikin daƙiƙa, da ake ajiye kiran REST a matsayin taska.','Specify an HTTP status code and the number of seconds to cache that page, separated by a space.'=>'Ayyana lambar matsayin HTTP da adadin daƙiƙoƙin da za a adana wancan shafi a ma\'ajiya, a raba su da sarari.','Browser Cache Settings'=>'Saitunan Cache na Browser','OpenLiteSpeed users please check this'=>'Masu amfani da OpenLiteSpeed don Allah ku duba wannan','Setting Up Custom Headers'=>'Ana Saita Shugabannin Musamman','Browser caching stores static files locally in the user\'s browser. Turn on this setting to reduce repeated requests for static files.'=>'Rungumar burauza (browser caching) na adana fayiloli masu tsauri a cikin burauzar mai amfani a gida. Kunna wannan saitin don rage maimaita buƙatun fayiloli masu tsauri.','You can turn on browser caching in server admin too. %sLearn more about LiteSpeed browser cache settings%s.'=>'Kuna iya kunna ɓoye bayanai na mai bincike a cikin mai gudanar da sabar ma. %sKoyi game da saitunan ɓoye bayanai na mai bincike na LiteSpeed%s.','The amount of time, in seconds, that files will be stored in browser cache before expiring.'=>'Adadin lokaci, a cikin daƙiƙa, da za a adana fayiloli a cikin cache na mai bincike kafin su ƙare.','Ignore certain query strings when caching. (LSWS %s required)'=>'Yi watsi da wasu kirtani na tambaya lokacin ajiyewa. (Ana buƙatar LSWS %s)','For example, to drop parameters beginning with %1$s, %2$s can be used here.'=>'Misali, don ajiye sigogin da suka fara da %1$s, ana iya amfani da %2$s anan.','Serve a separate cache copy for mobile visitors.'=>'Yi amfani da wani kwafin cache daban don baƙi na wayar hannu.','Learn more about when this is needed'=>'Ƙara koyo game da lokacin da ake buƙatar wannan','Htaccess did not match configuration option.'=>'Htaccess bai yi daidai da zaɓin saiti ba.','Htaccess rule is: %s'=>'Dokar Htaccess ita ce: %s','If %1$s is %2$s, then %3$s must be populated!'=>'Idan %1$s ya kasance %2$s, to dole ne a cika %3$s!','cookies'=>'cookies','user agents'=>'wakilan mai amfani','SYNTAX: alphanumeric and "_". No spaces and case sensitive. MUST BE UNIQUE FROM OTHER WEB APPLICATIONS.'=>'SYNTAX: alphanumeric da "_". Babu gurabure kuma an kula da babban da karamin bakake. DOLE NE YA ZAMA NA MUSAMMAN DAGA SAURAN AIKACE-AIKACE NA YANAR GIZO.','The default login cookie is %s.'=>'Tsohuwar kuki ta shiga ce %s.','The server will determine if the user is logged in based on the existence of this cookie.'=>'Serf din zai tantance ko mai amfani ya shiga bisa ga kasancewar wannan kuki.','This setting is useful for those that have multiple web applications for the same domain.'=>'Wannan saitin yana da amfani ga waɗanda ke da aikace-aikacen yanar gizo da yawa don guda ɗaya.','If every web application uses the same cookie, the server may confuse whether a user is logged in or not.'=>'Idan kowace aikace-aikacen yanar gizo tana amfani da guda ɗaya na cookie, uwar garken na iya rikicewa ko an shiga mai amفani ko a\'a.','The cookie set here will be used for this WordPress installation.'=>'Za a yi amfani da kuki da aka saita a nan don wannan shigarwar ta WordPress.','Example use case:'=>'Misalin amfani:','There is a WordPress installed for %s.'=>'An shigar da WordPress don %s.','Then another WordPress is installed (NOT MULTISITE) at %s'=>'Sannan an shigar da wani WordPress (BA MULTISITE ba) a %s','The cache needs to distinguish who is logged into which WordPress site in order to cache correctly.'=>'Cache ɗin na buƙatar bambanta wanda ke shiga cikin wanne shafin WordPress domin ya yi cache ɗin daidai.','Invalid login cookie. Invalid characters found.'=>'An ingantaccen kuki na shiga. An samo haruffa marasa inganci.','WARNING: The .htaccess login cookie and Database login cookie do not match.'=>'GARGADI: Alamar shiga ta .htaccess da Alamar shiga ta Database ba su yi daidai ba.','SYNTAX: alphanumeric and "_". No spaces and case sensitive.'=>'SYNTAX: alphanumeric da "_". Ba su da sarari kuma suna da hankali ga girman baki.','You can list the 3rd party vary cookies here.'=>'Kuna iya lissafa kukis na ɓangare na uku anan.','Enabled'=>'An kunna','Disabled'=>'An kashe','Not Available'=>'Ba a samuwa ba','Passed'=>'Sun wuce','Failed'=>'Ba a yi nasara ba','Object Cache Settings'=>'Saitunan Rumbun Ajiya ta Abu','Use external object cache functionality.'=>'Yi amfani da fasahar ajiyar abu na waje.','Status'=>'Matsayi','%s Extension'=>'Ƙarin %s','Connection Test'=>'Gwajin Haɗi','Your %s Hostname or IP address.'=>'Sunanka na mai watsa shiri ko adireshin IP na %s.','If you are using a %1$s socket, %2$s should be set to %3$s'=>'Idan kana amfani da soket na %1$s, ya kamata a saita %2$s zuwa %3$s','Default port for %1$s is %2$s.'=>'Tsohuwar tashar jiragen ruwa ta %1$s ita ce %2$s.','Default TTL for cached objects.'=>'Tsohon TTL don abubuwan da aka adana.','Only available when %s is installed.'=>'Ana samuwa ne kawai lokacin da aka sanya %s.','Specify the password used when connecting.'=>'Ƙayyade kalmar sirri da ake amfani da ita wajen haɗawa.','Database to be used'=>'Bayanan da za a yi amfani da su','Groups cached at the network level.'=>'Kungiyoyin da aka adana a matakin cibiyar sadarwa.','Use keep-alive connections to speed up cache operations.'=>'Yi amfani da haɗin yanar gizo na keep-alive don saurin ayyukan cache.','Improve wp-admin speed through caching. (May encounter expired data)'=>'Inganta saurin wp-admin ta hanyar caching. (Zai iya fuskantar tsoffin bayanai)','When enabled, the cache will automatically purge when any plugin, theme or the WordPress core is upgraded.'=>'Idan an kunna, cache za ta share kanta ta atomatik lokacin da aka sabunta kowane plugin, jigo (theme), ko kuma asalin WordPress.','Cloudflare Settings'=>'Saitunan Cloudflare','Use %s API functionality.'=>'Yi amfani da fasahar API ta %s.','Global API Key / API Token'=>'Maɓullin API na Duniya / Alamar API','Your API key / token is used to access %s APIs.'=>'Ana amfani da maɓallin API ɗinku / alamar ku don samun damar API na %s.','Get it from %s.'=>'Ka samo shi daga %s.','Recommended to generate the token from Cloudflare API token template "WordPress".'=>'An ba da shawarar a samar da token daga samfurin token na Cloudflare API "WordPress".','Email Address'=>'Adireshin Imel','Your Email address on %s.'=>'Adireshin imel dinka a kan %s.','Optional when API token used.'=>'Na zaɓi lokacin da aka yi amfani da alamar API.','Domain'=>'Yanki','You can just type part of the domain.'=>'Kuna iya rubuta wani ɓangare na yankin yanar gizon kawai.','Once saved, it will be matched with the current list and completed automatically.'=>'Da zarar an adana ta, za a daidaita ta da jerin na yanzu kuma a kammala ta ta atomatik.','Clear %s cache when "Purge All" is run.'=>'Share %s cache lokacin da aka gudanar da "Purge All".','To enable the following functionality, turn ON Cloudflare API in CDN Settings.'=>'Don kunna waɗannan ayyuka, kunna Cloudflare API a cikin Saitunan CDN.','Cloudflare Domain'=>'Yankin Cloudflare','Cloudflare Zone'=>'Yankin Cloudflare','Development Mode'=>'Yanayin Cigaba','Turn ON'=>'Kunna','Turn OFF'=>'Kashe','Check Status'=>'Binciki Matsayi','Current status is %1$s since %2$s.'=>'Matsayi na yanzu shine %1$s tun %2$s.','Current status is %s.'=>'Matsayi na yanzu shine %s.','Development mode will be automatically turned off in %s.'=>'Za a kashe yanayin ci gaba ta atomatik a cikin %s.','Temporarily bypass Cloudflare cache. This allows changes to the origin server to be seen in realtime.'=>'A rufe ma\'ajiyar Cloudflare na ɗan lokaci. Wannan yana ba da damar ganin canje-jejen sabar asali ainihin lokacin.','Development Mode will be turned off automatically after three hours.'=>'Za a kashe Yanayin Ci Gaba da kansa bayan awanni uku.','%1$sLearn More%2$s'=>'%1$sKara Koyo%2$s','Cloudflare Cache'=>'Cache din Cloudflare','Purge Everything'=>'Share Duka Komai','Other Static CDN'=>'Wani CDN Mai Tsaye Na Daban','Zinn® Cache Engine CDN'=>'Zinn® Cache Engine CDN','CDN Settings'=>'Saitunan CDN','Turn this setting %s if you are using a traditional Content Delivery Network (CDN) or a subdomain for static content.'=>'Kunna wannan saitin %s idan kana amfani da wani tsohon Tsarin Isar da Abun Ciki (CDN) ko ƙaramin yanki don abun ciki mai tsauri.','NOTE: Cloudflare does not use CDN Mapping. If you are only using Cloudflare, leave this setting %s.'=>'LURA: Cloudflare ba ta amfani da Taswirar CDN (CDN Mapping). Idan kuna amfani da Cloudflare kawai, bar wannan saitin ya zama %s.','To randomize CDN hostname, define multiple hostnames for the same resources.'=>'Don ba da umarni ba ga suna mai masaukin baki na CDN, a bayyana sunayen masu masaukin baki da yawa don ɗaya da kayan aiki.','Serve all image files through the CDN. This will affect all attachments, HTML %1$s tags, and CSS %2$s attributes.'=>'Yi amfani da CDN don yada duk fayilolin hoto. Wannan zai shafi duk abubuwan da aka makala, alamomin HTML %1$s, da siffofin CSS %2$s.','Serve all CSS files through the CDN. This will affect all enqueued WP CSS files.'=>'Ka yi amfani da CDN don yada duk fayilolin CSS. Wannan zai shafi duk fayilolin WP CSS da aka tsara.','Serve all JavaScript files through the CDN. This will affect all enqueued WP JavaScript files.'=>'Yi amfani da CDN wajen yada duk fayilolin JavaScript. Wannan zai shafi duk fayilolin JavaScript na WP da aka jera a jerin gwano.','Static file type links to be replaced by CDN links.'=>'Za a maye gurbin hanyoyin haɗi na nau\'in fayil na tsaye da hanyoyin haɗi na CDN.','This will affect all tags containing attributes: %s.'=>'Wannan zai shafi duk alamomin da ke dauke da siffofi: %s.','If you turn any of the above settings OFF, please remove the related file types from the %s box.'=>'Idan ka kashe kowane daga cikin waɗannan saitunan da ke sama, da fatan za a cire nau\'ikan fayilolin da suka dace daga akwatin %s.','Specify which HTML element attributes will be replaced with CDN Mapping.'=>'Kayyade wane siffofin abubuwan HTML da za a maye gurbinsu da Taswirar CDN.','Only attributes listed here will be replaced.'=>'Abubuwan da aka lissafa a nan kadai za a maye gurbinsu.','Use the format %1$s or %2$s (element is optional).'=>'Yi amfani da tsarin %1$s ko %2$s (abu na zaɓi ne).','Site URL to be served through the CDN. Beginning with %1$s. For example, %2$s.'=>'URL din Shafin da za a yi wa hidima ta hanyar CDN. Farawa da %1$s. Misali, %2$s.','Only files within these directories will be pointed to the CDN.'=>'Fayiloli kawai da ke cikin waɗannan kundin adireshin za a nuna su ga CDN.','Paths containing these strings will not be served from the CDN.'=>'Hanyoyin da suka ƙunshi waɗannan rubututtukan ba za a ba da su daga CDN ba.','Are you sure to delete all existing blocklist items?'=>'Kuna da tabbas za ku goge duk abubuwan da ke cikin jerin an haramta su?','Empty blocklist'=>'Sharewar wofilar baki','Blocklist'=>'Jerin sunayen da aka hana','Total'=>'Jimla','URL'=>'URL','Operation'=>'Aiki','Remove from Blocklist'=>'Cire daga Jerin Abubuwan da aka Ƙi','API: PHP Constant %s available to disable blocklist.'=>'API: Akwai PHP Constant %s don kashe blocklist.','API: Filter %s available to disable blocklist.'=>'API: Tace %s akwai don kashe lissafin da aka toshe.','Not blocklisted'=>'Ba a hana shi jerin ba','Blocklisted due to not cacheable'=>'An saka shi a cikin jerin masu hana shiga saboda ba za a iya adana shi a cache ba','Blocklisted'=>'An hana','Summary'=>'Takaitawa','Map'=>'Taswira','Zinn® Cache Engine Crawler'=>'Mai Rarrafe na Zinn® Cache Engine','Clean Crawler Map'=>'Tsabtace Taswirar Mai Rarrafe','Refresh Crawler Map'=>'Sabunta Taswirar Mai Rarrafe','Generated at %s'=>'An samar da shi a %s','Sitemap List'=>'Jerin Taswirar Shafi','Sitemap Total'=>'Jimillar Taswirar Yanar Gizo','URL Search'=>'Binciken URL','Cache Hit'=>'Cache Hit','Cache Miss'=>'Rashin Cache','Crawler Status'=>'Matsayin Mai Bincike','Add to Blocklist'=>'Ƙara zuwa Lissafin Block','Crawler General Settings'=>'Babban Saitunan Crawler','This will enable crawler cron.'=>'Wannan zai ba da damar yin amfani da crawler cron.','Specify how long in seconds before the crawler should initiate crawling the entire sitemap again.'=>'Ka bayyana tsawon lokaci a cikin daƙiƙa kafin mai binciken yanar gizo ya sake fara binciken dukan taswirar shafin (sitemap).','The crawler will use your XML sitemap or sitemap index. Enter the full URL to your sitemap here.'=>'Mai rarrafe zai yi amfani da taswirar shafin ku ta XML ko kuma fihirisar taswirar shafin. Shigar da cikakkiyar URL zuwa taswirar shafin ku anan.','The maximum average server load allowed while crawling. The number of crawler threads in use will be actively reduced until average server load falls under this limit. If this cannot be achieved with a single thread, the current crawler run will be terminated.'=>'Matsakaicin nauyin uwar garken da aka yarda dashi yayin lalowa. Za a rage adadin zaren lalowa da ake amfani da su sosai har sai matsakaicin nauyin uwar garken ya fadi a ƙasan wannan iyaka. Idan ba a iya cimma wannan ba tare da zare guda ɗaya ba, za a dakatar da guduwar lalowa ta yanzu.','Server enforced value: %s'=>'Darajar da uwar garken ta tilasta: %s','Server allowed max value: %s'=>'Matsakaicin ƙimar da aka bari na uwar garken: %s','To crawl the site as a logged-in user, enter the user ids to be simulated.'=>'Don shiga rukunin yanar gizon a matsayin mai amfani da ya shiga, shigar da lambobin masu amfani da za a kwaikwaya.','You must set %s before using this feature.'=>'Dole ne ka saita %s kafin ka yi amfani da wannan fasalin.','Click here to set.'=>'Danna nan don saitawa.','You must set %1$s to %2$s before using this feature.'=>'Dole ne ka saita %1$s zuwa %2$s kafin amfani da wannan fasalin.','To crawl for a particular cookie, enter the cookie name, and the values you wish to crawl for. Values should be one per line. There will be one crawler created per cookie value, per simulated role.'=>'Don binciken wani takamaiman kuki, shigar da sunan kukin, da ƙimar da kake son bincikawa. Ya kamata ƙimar ta kasance ɗaya a kowane layi. Za a ƙirƙiri mai bincike ɗaya a kowane ƙimar kuki, a kowane matsayi da aka kwaikwaya.','Use %1$s in %2$s to indicate this cookie has not been set.'=>'Yi amfani da %1$s a cikin %2$s don nuna cewa ba a saita wannan kukis din ba.','You need to set the %s in Settings first before using the crawler'=>'Kuna buƙatar saita %s a cikin Settings tukunna kafin amfani da crawler','Crawler Cron'=>'Crawler Cron','The crawler feature is not enabled on the LiteSpeed server. Please consult your server admin or hosting provider.'=>'Ba a kunna fasalin crawler ba a kan uwar garken LiteSpeed. Da fatan za a tuntuɓi mai gudanar da uwar garken ku ko mai ba da sabis na ba da baki.','See %sIntroduction for Enabling the Crawler%s for detailed information.'=>'Duba %sIntroduction for Enabling the Crawler%s don samun cikakken bayani.','Current sitemap crawl started at'=>'An fara binciken sitemap na yanzu a ranar','The next complete sitemap crawl will start at'=>'Za a fara binciken cikakken taswirar shafin na gaba a','Last complete run time for all crawlers'=>'Lokacin aikin karshe da ya cika ga dukkan masu shawagi','%d seconds'=>'sekondi %d','Run time for previous crawler'=>'Lokacin gudu don mai rarrafe na baya','Current crawler started at'=>'Lokacin da mai bincike na yanar gizo na yanzu ya fara a','Current server load'=>'Load na uwar garken a yanzu','Last interval'=>'Lokaci na ƙarshe','Ended reason'=>'Dalilin ƙarewa','Last crawled'=>'An shiga kwanan nan','%d item(s)'=>'abubuwa %d','Reset position'=>'Sake saiti','Manually run'=>'Yi amfani da hannu','Cron Name'=>'Sunan Cron','Run Frequency'=>'Maimaita Sauyawa','Activate'=>'Kunna','Running'=>'Ana guduwa','Waiting'=>'Ana jiran','Hit'=>'Danna','Miss'=>'Ba a yi ba','Position: '=>'Matsayi:','running'=>'na gudu','Waiting to be Crawled'=>'Ana jiran a yi rarrafe','Already Cached'=>'An riga an adana a mahadi','Successfully Crawled'=>'An Yi Nasarar Crawling Dinsa','Run frequency is set by the Interval Between Runs setting.'=>'An saita mitar gudu ta hanyar saitin Tazara Tsakanin Gudu.','Crawlers cannot run concurrently. If both the cron and a manual run start at similar times, the first to be started will take precedence.'=>'Ba za a iya gudanar da masu shiga shafuka a lokaci guda ba. Idan duka cron da kuma gudanarwa ta hannu suka fara a lokuta masu kama da juna, wanda aka fara fara wa shi ne zai zama na farko.','Please see %sHooking WP-Cron Into the System Task Scheduler%s to learn how to create the system cron task.'=>'Don Allah duba %sHooking WP-Cron Into the System Task Scheduler%s don koyon yadda ake ƙirƙirar aikin tsarin cron.','Watch Crawler Status'=>'Kalli Matsayin Masu Rarrafe','Show crawler status'=>'Nuna matsayin mai binciken yanar gizo','Start watching...'=>'Fara kallo...','No crawler meta file generated yet'=>'Ba a samar da fayil ɗin meta na mai rarrafe ba tukuna','Cache Status'=>'Matsayin Cache','More'=>'Ƙari','Public Cache'=>'Bayanin Ajiya na Jama\'a','Private Cache'=>'Keɓaɓɓen Ma\'ajiya','Crawler(s)'=>'Mai shiga yanar gizo (Crawler)','Currently active crawler'=>'Mai rarrafe da aiki a halin yanzu','%1$s %2$d item(s)'=>'%1$s abubuwa %2$d','Last crawled:'=>'An bincika karshe:','News'=>'Labarai','Network Dashboard'=>'Kwamitin Sadarwa','Zinn® Cache Engine Dashboard'=>'Dashboard na Zinn® Cache Engine','Usage Statistics: %s'=>'Kididdigar Amfani: %s','CDN Bandwidth'=>'Adadin Bandwidth na CDN','Low Quality Image Placeholder'=>'Wurin Ajiyewar Hoton Mara Inganci Mai Kyau','Fast Queue Usage'=>'Amfani da Layi Mai Saurin Gudu','Usage'=>'Amfani','Pay as You Go'=>'Biya Yayin Da Kake Guda','PAYG Balance'=>'Ma\'aunin PAYG','This Month Usage: %s'=>'Amfani na Wannan Wata: %s','Pay as You Go Usage Statistics'=>'Kididdigar Amfani ta Biya Yayin da Kake Amfani','Total Usage'=>'Jimlar Amfani','Total images optimized in this month'=>'Jimlar hotunan da aka inganta a wannan wata','DB Optimization Settings'=>'Saitunan Inganta Database','Zinn® Cache Engine Database Optimization'=>'Haɓaka Ramin Bayanai na Injinin Cache na Zinn®','Clean All'=>'Tace Duka','Post Revisions'=>'Gyaran Rubutu','Clean all post revisions'=>'Share sauran gyare-gyaren post duka','Orphaned Post Meta'=>'Meta ɗin da aka yi watsi da ita','Clean all orphaned post meta records'=>'Wanke duk bayanan post meta da suka zama marasa tushe','Auto Drafts'=>'Shirye-shiryen da aka yi kanta','Clean all auto saved drafts'=>'Share duk abubuwan da aka adana ta atomatik','Trashed Posts'=>'Rubabbun Rubuce-rubuce','Clean all trashed posts and pages'=>'Wanke duk goge-gogen da aka jefa a kwandon shara da shafuka','Spam Comments'=>'Sharhin Bata-gari','Clean all spam comments'=>'Share tsaftace dukkan sharhin spam','Trashed Comments'=>'Sharhi da aka share','Clean all trashed comments'=>'Goge duk abubuwan da aka sharar da suka fice','Trackbacks/Pingbacks'=>'Abubuwan dawo da waƙoƙi / Pingbacks','Clean all trackbacks and pingbacks'=>'Tsabtace duk abubuwan biyan baya da pingbacks','Expired Transients'=>'Wucewarran da suka ƙare','Clean expired transient options'=>'Share gajiyayyun zabuɓɓuka marasa amfani','All Transients'=>'Duk ɗan lokaci','Clean all transient options'=>'Tace duk zaɓuɓɓukan wucin gadi','Optimize Tables'=>'Inganta Teburiloli','Optimize all tables in your database'=>'Inganta dukkan teburai a cikin bayanan ku','Clean revisions older than %1$s day(s), excluding %2$s latest revisions'=>'Share gyare-gyaren da suka wuce kwanaki %1$s, ban da sabbin gyare-gyare %2$s na karshe','Database Optimizer'=>'Mai inganta Bayanan Bayanai','Database Table Engine Converter'=>'Mai Juyya Injiniyar Teburkin Bayanan','Table'=>'Tebur','Engine'=>'Injin','Tool'=>'Kayan aiki','Convert to InnoDB'=>'Canza zuwa InnoDB','We are good. No table uses MyISAM engine.'=>'Muna cikin koshin lafiya. Babu teburin da ke amfani da injin MyISAM.','Database Summary'=>'Takaitaccen Bayanin Bayanan Sirri','Autoload size'=>'Girman lodawa ta atomatik','Autoload entries'=>'Abubuwan lodawa ta atomatik','Autoload top list'=>'Jerin manyan da ake lodi ta atomatik','Option Name'=>'Sunan Zaɓi','Autoload'=>'Autoload','Size'=>'Girma','Specify the number of most recent revisions to keep when cleaning revisions.'=>'Sanya adadin sababbin gyare-gyare mafi kusa da za a riƙe lokacin da ake tsabtace gyare-gyare.','Day(s)'=>'Kwana (Kwanaki)','Revisions newer than this many days will be kept when cleaning revisions.'=>'Za a riƙe bita waɗanda suka fi kwanaki nawa sabuwa sabuwa lokacin da ake tsaftace bita.','Public'=>'Na jama\'a','Private'=>'Maigirma','Disable'=>'Kashe','Widget Cache TTL'=>'TTL na Ma\'ajiyar Widget','Recommended value: 28800 seconds (8 hours).'=>'Kimar da aka ba da shawarar: daƙiƙa 28800 (awowi 8).','A TTL of 0 indicates do not cache.'=>'TTL na 0 yana nuna kar a adana a cikin cache.','General Settings'=>'Saitunan Gaba ɗaya','Zinn® Cache Engine General Settings'=>'Saitunan Janar na Injin Cache na Zinn®','Use Primary Site Configuration'=>'Yi Amfani da Ingantaccen Tsarin Shafin','Check this option to use the primary site\'s configuration for all subsites.'=>'Duba wannan zaɓi don amfani da saitin babban shafin don duk ƙananan shafuka.','This will disable the settings page on all subsites.'=>'Wannan zai kashe shafin saituna a duk ƙananan shafuka.','This option enables maximum optimization for Guest Mode visitors.'=>'Wannan zaɓi yana ba da damar ingantawa mafi girma ga baƙi na Yanayin Baƙo (Guest Mode).','Please read all warnings before enabling this option.'=>'Da fatan za a karanta duk gargadi kafin a kunna wannan zabin.','Notice'=>'Sanarwa','%s must be turned ON for this setting to work.'=>'Dole ne a kunna %s domin wannan saitin ya yi aiki.','You need to turn %s on to get maximum result.'=>'Kuna buƙatar kunna %s don samun mafi girman sakamako.','You need to turn %s on and finish all WebP generation to get maximum result.'=>'Kuna buƙatar kunnashe %s ku gama duk ƙirƙirar WebP don samun sakamako mafi girma.','Enter this site\'s IP address to allow cloud services directly call IP instead of domain name. This eliminates the overhead of DNS and CDN lookups.'=>'Shigar da adireshin IP na wannan shafin don ba da damar sabis na girgije su kira IP kai tsaye maimakon sunan yanki. Wannan yana kawar da wahalar binciken DNS da CDN.','Your server IP'=>'IP din uwar garken ku','Check my public IP from'=>'Bincika IP ta jama\'a ta daga','the auto-detected IP may not be accurate if you have an additional outgoing IP set, or you have multiple IPs configured on your server.'=>'Wuri mai fitowa da kansa wanda aka gano ƙila ba zai yi daidai ba idan kana da ƙarin wuri mai fitowa da aka saita, ko kuma kana da wurare masu fitowa da yawa da aka saita a kan sabar ka.','Please make sure this IP is the correct one for visiting your site.'=>'Don Allah tabbatar cewa wannan IP shi ne daidai domin ziyartar shafinka.','Turn this option ON to show latest news automatically, including hotfixes, new releases, available beta versions, and promotions.'=>'Kunna wannan zabin don nuna sabbin labarai ta atomatik, gami da gyare-gyare masu zafi, sabbin abubuwan da aka fitar, samfuran beta da ke akwai, da kuma tallace-tallace.','Turn this option ON to have Zinn® Cache Engine updated automatically, whenever a new version is released. If OFF, update manually as usual.'=>'Kunna wannan zaɓi ON don samun Zinn® Cache Engine an sabunta shi ta atomatik, duk lokacin da aka fitar da sabon sig apabila. Idan OFF, sabunta da hannu kamar yadda aka saba.','Guest Mode provides an always cacheable landing page for an automated guest\'s first time visit, and then attempts to update cache varies via AJAX.'=>'Yanayin Baƙo yana ba da shafin sauka wanda ake iya adana shi a cikin ma\'ajiyar ɗan lokaci a kowane lokaci don ziyarar farko ta baƙo ta atomatik, sannan yana ƙoƙarin sabunta bambance-bambancen ma\'ajiyar ta hanyar AJAX.','This option can help to correct the cache vary for certain advanced mobile or tablet visitors.'=>'Wannan zaɓin na iya taimakawa wajen gyara bambancin cache ga wasുatattun masu ziyara ta wayar hannu ko kwamfutar tafi-da-gidanka masu ci gaba.','Guest Mode testing result'=>'Sakamakon gwajin Yanayin Baƙo','Testing'=>'Gwaji','Guest Mode IP/UA sync status'=>'Matsayin aikin daidaita IP/UA na Yanayin Baƙo','Syncing'=>'Ana aiki daidaita','Guest Mode passed testing.'=>'An wuce da gwajin Yanayin Baƙo.','Guest Mode failed to test.'=>'Yanayin baƙo ya kasa gwadawa.','Synced successfully.'=>'An daidaita nasarar.','Sync failed.'=>'Taidaitawa ta ƙara.','Image Optimization Summary'=>'Takaitaccen Bayanin Inganta Hotuna','Image Optimization Settings'=>'Saitunan Inganta Hoto','Zinn® Cache Engine Image Optimization'=>'Zinn® Cache Engine Ƙaddamar da Hotuna','Request WebP/AVIF versions of original images when doing optimization.'=>'Nemi sifofin WebP/AVIF na asalin hotuna yayin yin ingantawa.','Significantly improve load time by replacing images with their optimized %s versions.'=>'Inganta saurin lodi sosai ta hanyar maye gurbin hotuna da ingantattun nau\'ikansu na %s.','When switching formats, please %1$s or %2$s to apply this new choice to previously optimized images.'=>'Lokacin da ake canza fomat, don Allah ka %1$s ko ka %2$s don amfani da wannan sabon zaɓi ga hotunan da aka inganta a baya.','Destroy All Optimization Data'=>'Rushe Duk Bayanan Ingantawa','Soft Reset Optimization Counter'=>'Maɓallin Inganta Sauye-sauye na Farko','Automatically request optimization via cron job.'=>'Nemi haɓakawa ta atomatik ta hanyar aikin cron.','Optimize images and save backups of the originals in the same folder.'=>'Inganta hotuna kuma a adana kwafin ajiya na asali a cikin kundin adireshi guda.','Automatically remove the original image backups after fetching optimized images.'=>'Cire hotunan asali da suka gabata ta atomatik bayan da aka dawo da ingantattun hotuna.','This is irreversible.'=>'Wannan ba za a iya juyawa ba.','You will be unable to Revert Optimization once the backups are deleted!'=>'Ba za ku iya Sake Juya Ingantawa ba da zaran an goge ajiyar bayanai!','Optimize images using lossless compression.'=>'Inganta hotuna ta amfani da matsewa mai inganci mara asara.','This can improve quality but may result in larger images than lossy compression will.'=>'Wannan na iya inganta inganci amma yana iya haifar da manyan hotuna fiye da yadda matsewar asara za ta iya yi.','No sizes found.'=>'Ba a sami girma ba.','Choose which image sizes to optimize.'=>'Zaɓi girman hoton da za a inganta.','Preserve EXIF data (copyright, GPS, comments, keywords, etc) when optimizing.'=>'Kiyaye bayanan EXIF (hakkin mallaka, GPS, tsokaci, maɓallan kalmomi, da sauransu) lokacin da kake ingantawa.','This will increase the size of optimized files.'=>'Wannan zai ƙara girman fayilolin da aka inganta.','Specify which element attributes will be replaced with WebP/AVIF.'=>'Yi bayanin wanne sifa ta kashi za a maye gurbinsu da WebP/AVIF.','Enable replacement of WebP/AVIF in %s elements that were generated outside of WordPress logic.'=>'Ba da damar maye gurbin WebP/AVIF a cikin abubuwan %s waɗanda aka ƙirƙira a wajen tsarin WordPress.','Current closest Cloud server is %s. Click to redetect.'=>'Server din Cloud mafi kusa da kai a yanzu shi ne %s. Danna don sake gano shi.','Are you sure you want to redetect the closest cloud server for this service?'=>'Kuna da tabbas kuna son sake gano sabar gajimare mafi kusa don wannan hidimar?','Redetect'=>'Sake ganowa','Image optimisation'=>'Inganta hoto','You can request a maximum of %s images at once.'=>'Kuna iya neman matsakaicin hotuna %s a lokaci guda.','To make sure our server can communicate with your server without any issues and everything works fine, for the few first requests the number of image groups allowed in a single request is limited.'=>'Don tabbatar cewa sabarmu za ta iya hulɗa da sabarka ba tare da wata matsala ba kuma komai yana aiki lafiya, ga buƙatun farko kaɗan, an iyakance adadin rukunin hotunan da aka yarda a cikin buƙatu ɗaya.','Current limit is'=>'Iyakacin yanzu shine','Send Optimization Request'=>'Aika da Bukatar Ingantawa','Available after %d second(s)'=>'Akwai bayan daƙiƙa %d','Only press the button if the pull cron job is disabled.'=>'Ka danna maballin ne kawai idan an kashe aikin pull cron.','Images will be pulled automatically if the cron job is running.'=>'Za a jawo hotuna ta atomatik idan aikin cron yana aiki.','Pull Images'=>'Jawo Hotuna','Optimization Status'=>'Matsayi na Inganta Aiki','When the optimisation server finishes, it notifies your site to pull the optimised images.'=>'Lokacin da sabar ingantawa ta kammala, tana sanar da shafin ku don jawohotunan da aka inganta.','This process is automatic.'=>'Wannan tsari ne mai zuwa da kansa.','Last pull initiated by cron at %s.'=>'Cron ne ya fara janye na karshe a %s.','Storage Optimization'=>'Inganta Ma\'aji','A backup of each image is saved before it is optimized.'=>'Ana adana kwafin kowane hoto kafin a inganta shi.','Last calculated'=>'An lissafta karshe','Files'=>'Fayiloli','Calculate Original Image Storage'=>'Lissafin Ajiyar Asalin Hoto','Calculate Backups Disk Space'=>'Lissafi Sararin Disk na Ma\'ajiyar Bayanai','Image Thumbnail Group Sizes'=>'Girman Ƙungiyar Hotunan Ƙanana','Delete all backups of the original images'=>'Goge duk madadin adana bayanai na asalin hotunan','Last ran'=>'An gabatar da shi na karshe','Saved'=>'An adana','Are you sure you want to remove all image backups?'=>'Kuna da tabbas kuna son cire duk madadin hotunan?','Remove Original Image Backups'=>'Cire Asalin Hotunan Ajiyar Waje','Image Information'=>'Bayanin Hoto','Image groups total'=>'Jimlar rukunin hotuna','Congratulations, all gathered!'=>'Taya murna, an tattara komai!','What is a group?'=>'Menene rukuni?','What is an image group?'=>'Menene rukunin hotuna?','Current image post id position'=>'Matsayi na yanzu na wurin buga hoto','Maximum image post id'=>'Matsakaicin ID na hoton da aka fi turawa','Scan for any new unoptimized image thumbnail sizes and resend necessary image optimization requests.'=>'Bincike don neman kowane sabon girman hoton da ba a inganta ba kuma a sake aika buƙatun inganta hoton da suka dace.','Rescan New Thumbnails'=>'Sake Duba Sabbin Hotuna','Optimization Summary'=>'Takaitaccen Ingantawa','Total Reduction'=>'Jimlar Ragewa','Images Pulled'=>'An Jawo Hotuna','Last Request'=>'Buƙatar Ƙarshe','Last Pulled'=>'An Jawo Na Karshe','Results can be checked in %sMedia Library%s.'=>'Ana iya duba sakamoko a cikin %sMedia Library%s.','Optimization Tools'=>'Kayan Aikin Ingantawa','You can quickly switch between using original (unoptimized versions) and optimized image files. It will affect all images on your website, both regular and webp versions if available.'=>'Kuna iya saurin sauyawa tsakanin amfani da ainihin fayilolin hotuna (marasa inganta) da waɗanda aka inganta. Wannan zai shafi duk hotunan da ke kan gidan yanar gizon ku, duka na yau da kullun da kuma sifofin webp idan akwai su.','Use original images (unoptimized) on your site'=>'Yi amfani da ainihin hotuna (marasa sauƙaƙe) a shafinka','Use Original Files'=>'Yi Amfani da Ainihin Fayilolin','Switch back to using optimized images on your site'=>'Komawa zuwa amfani da ingantattun hotuna a shafinka','Use Optimized Files'=>'Yi Amfani da Fayilolin da Aka Inganta','This will reset the %1$s. If you changed WebP/AVIF settings and want to generate %2$s for the previously optimized images, use this action.'=>'Wannan zai sake saita %1$s. Idan ka canza saitunan WebP/AVIF kuma kana son samar da %2$s don hotunan da aka inganta a baya, yi amfani da wannan aikin.','Are you sure to destroy all optimized images?'=>'Shin kana da tabbatacin share duk ingantattun hotunan?','Remove all previous image optimization requests/results, revert completed optimizations, and delete all optimization files.'=>'Cire duk wasu buƙatun/sakamakon inganta hotuna na baya, mayar da ingantattun da aka gama, kuma a goge duk fayilolin ingantawa.','Read the upstream Zinn® Cache Engine documentation'=>'Karanta takardun bayanin Zinn® Cache Engine na sama','Zinn Digital® support'=>'Goyon baya na Zinn Digital®','Zinn® Cache Engine user guide'=>'Jagorar mai amfani na Zinn® Cache Engine','To use the caching functions you must have a LiteSpeed or OpenLiteSpeed web server with the LSCache module.'=>'Don amfani da ayyukan ajiyar wucin gadi, dole ne ku sami uwar garken gidan yanar gizo na LiteSpeed ko OpenLiteSpeed tare da mojull din LSCache.','Please enable the LSCache Module at the server level, or ask your hosting provider.'=>'Da fatan za a kunna LSCache Module a matakin uwar garken, ko kuma a nemi mai ba ku sabis na daukar gidan yanar gizo.','Please enable Zinn® Cache Engine in the plugin settings.'=>'Da fat za a kunna Zinn® Cache Engine a cikin saitunan plugin din.','LSCache caching functions on this page are currently unavailable!'=>'Ayyukan ajiyar bayanan LSCache a wannan shafin ba su da aiki a halin yanzu!','The network admin selected use primary site configs for all subsites.'=>'Mai gudanar da cibiyar sadarwa ya zaɓi amfani da saitunan shafin farko don duk ƙananan shafuka.','The following options are selected, but are not editable in this settings page.'=>'An zaɓi waɗannan zaɓuɓɓuka masu zuwa, amma ba za a iya gyara su ba a wannan shafin saituna.','LiteSpeed cache plugin upgraded. Please refresh the page to complete the configuration data upgrade.'=>'An sabunta plugin din LiteSpeed cache. Da fatan za a sabunta shafin don kammala sabunta bayanan da\'ira na saiti.','Deactivate Zinn® Cache Engine'=>'Kashe Injin Cache na Zinn®','The deactivation is temporary'=>'Deactivation ɗin na ɗan lokaci ne','Site performance is worse'=>'Aikin shafin ya ragu sosai','Plugin is too complicated'=>'Farantin yana da rikitarwa sosai','Other'=>'Sauran','Why are you deactivating the plugin?'=>'Me yasa kake kashe filogin?','On uninstall, all plugin settings will be deleted.'=>'Lokacin da aka cire, za a goge duk saitunan fakitin aikace-aikacen.','If you have used Image Optimization, please %sDestroy All Optimization Data%s first. NOTE: this does not remove your optimized images.'=>'Idan ka yi amfani da Inganta Hotuna, da fatan za a fara %sKashe Duk Bayanan Ingantawa%s. LURA: Wannan ba ya cire hotunanka masu inganci.','Deactivate'=>'Kashe aikin','Deactivate plugin'=>'Kashe plugin','Close popup'=>'Rufe taga','Zinn® Cache Engine plugin is installed!'=>'An shigar da Zinn® Cache Engine plugin!','This message indicates that the plugin was installed by the server admin.'=>'Wannan sakon yana nuna cewa mai kula da uwar garken (server) ne ya shigar da plugin ɗin.','The Zinn® Cache Engine plugin is used to cache pages - a simple way to improve the performance of the site.'=>'Ana amfani da matosai na Zinn® Cache Engine don adana shafuka a wurin ajiyar wucin gadi - hanya ce mai sauƙi don inganta aikin rukunin yanar gizon.','However, there is no way of knowing all the possible customizations that were implemented.'=>'Duk da haka, babu wata yadda za a yi a san duk yiwuwar gyare-gyaren da aka aiwatar.','For that reason, please test the site to make sure everything still functions properly.'=>'Saboda wannan dalili, da fatan za a gwadá shafin don tabbatar da cewa komai yana ci gaba da aiki yadda ya kamata.','Examples of test cases include:'=>'Misalan shari\'o\'in gwaji sun haɗa da:','Visit the site while logged out.'=>'Ziyarci shafin yayin da ba ka shiga ba.','Create a post, make sure the front page is accurate.'=>'Ka ƙirƙiri wani sakon, ka tabbatar shafin farko yana daidai.','If there are any questions, the team is always happy to answer any questions on the %ssupport forum%s.'=>'Idan akwai wasu tambayoyi, ƙungiyar tana farin cikin amsa kowace tambaya a kan %sdandalin goyon baya%s.','If you would rather not move at litespeed, you can deactivate this plugin.'=>'Idan ba ka son yin amfani da litespeed, za ka iya kashe wannan plugin ɗin.','NOTICE: Database login cookie did not match your login cookie.'=>'SANARWA: Cookie na shiga rumbun bayanai bai yi daidai da cookie na shigar da ku ba.','If the login cookie was recently changed in the settings, please log out and back in.'=>'Idan an canza kuki na shiga kwanan nan a cikin saitunan, da fatan za a fice kuma a sake shiga.','If not, please verify the setting in the %sAdvanced tab%s.'=>'Idan ba haka ba, don Allah a tabbatar da saitunan da ke cikin %sAdvanced tab%s.','If using OpenLiteSpeed, the server must be restarted once for the changes to take effect.'=>'Idan ana amfani da OpenLiteSpeed, dole ne a sake kunna sabarar sau ɗaya domin canje-canjen su yi aiki.','Unexpected cache rule %2$s found in %1$s file. This rule may cause visitors to see old versions of pages due to the browser caching HTML pages. If you are sure that HTML pages are not being browser cached, this message can be dismissed. (%3$sLearn More%4$s)'=>'An gano dokar cache mara tsammani %2$s a cikin fayil %1$s. Wannan dokar na iya sa baƙi su ga tsoffin juzu\'ai na shafuka saboda cache 100% na burusa da ke ajiye shafukan HTML. Idan kana da tabbacin cewa ba a ajiye shafukan HTML a cikin cache na burusa ba, ana iya wulakanta wannan sakon. (%3$sKara Koyo%4$s)','OptimaX Summary'=>'Takaitaccen bayanin OptimaX','OptimaX Settings'=>'Saitunan OptimaX','Zinn® Cache Engine OptimaX'=>'Zinn® Cache Engine OptimaX','Turn on OptimaX. This will automatically request your pages OptimaX result via cron job.'=>'Kunna OptimaX. Wannan zai neme sakamakon shafukanka na OptimaX ta atomatik ta hanyar cron job.','CSS Settings'=>'Saitunan CSS','JS Settings'=>'Saitunan JS','HTML Settings'=>'Saitunan HTML','Media Settings'=>'Saitunan Kafofin Watsa Labarai','VPI'=>'VPI','Media Excludes'=>'Ba da Watsa Labarai ba','Localization'=>'Fassara harsuna','Tuning'=>'Gyara','Zinn® Cache Engine Page Optimization'=>'Haɓaka Shafin Injiniyar Cache na Zinn®','Please test thoroughly when enabling any option in this list. After changing Minify/Combine settings, please do a Purge All action.'=>'Da fat za a gwada sosai lokacin da aka kunna kowane zaɓi a cikin wannan jerin. Bayan canza saitunan Minify/Combine, da fat za a yi aikin Purge All.','Minify CSS files and inline CSS code.'=>'Takaita fayilolin CSS tare da sanya lambar CSS a ciki.','Combine CSS files and inline CSS code.'=>'Haɗa fayilolin CSS da lambar CSS ta cikin layi.','How to Fix Problems Caused by CSS/JS Optimization.'=>'Yadda ake Gyara Matsalolin da Inganta CSS/JS ke Haifarwa.','Generate unique CSS through an online generation service.'=>'Yi amfani da sabis na ƙirƙirar CSS ta Intanet domin samun wasu keɓaɓɓun lambobin CSS.','This will drop the unused CSS on each page from the combined file.'=>'Wannan zai cire marasa amfani CSS a kowane shafi daga fayil ɗin da aka haɗa.','Automatic generation of unique CSS is in the background via a cron-based queue.'=>'Ana samar da keɓaɓɓen CSS ta atomatik a bango ta amfani da jerin gwano na cron.','Filter %s available for UCSS per page type generation.'=>'Tacewa %s akwai don samar da nau\'in shafi na UCSS.','This option is bypassed because %1$s option is %2$s.'=>'An wuce wannan zaɓin domin zaɓin %1$s shi ne %2$s.','Last generated'=>'An ƙirƙira shi a ƙarshe','Last requested cost'=>'Kudin da aka nema na karshe','URL list in %s queue waiting for cron'=>'Jerin URL a cikin layin jira na %s suna jiran cron','Clear'=>'Sharewa','Run %s Queue Manually'=>'Gudanar da Jerin %s da Kansa','Inline UCSS to reduce the extra CSS file loading. This option will not be automatically turned on for %1$s pages. To use it on %1$s pages, please set it to ON.'=>'Sanya UCSS cikin layin don rage ƙarin lodi na fayilolin CSS. Wannan zaɓi ba za a kunna shi ta atomatik ba don shafukan %1$s. Don amfani da shi a kan shafukan %1$s, don Allah a saita shi zuwa KUNNA (ON).','This option will automatically bypass %s option.'=>'Wannan zaɓin zai tsallake zaɓin %s ta atomatik.','Include external CSS and inline CSS in combined file when %1$s is also enabled. This option helps maintain the priorities of CSS, which should minimize potential errors caused by CSS Combine.'=>'Ƙara CSS na waje da inline CSS a cikin haɗaɗren fayil lokacin da aka kuma kunna %1$s. Wannan zaɓin yana taimakawa wajen kiyaye muhimman abubuwan CSS, wanda ya kamata ya rage damar samun kuskuren da CSS Combine ke haifarwa.','Optimize CSS delivery.'=>'Inganta isar da CSS.','This can improve your speed score in services like Pingdom, GTmetrix and PageSpeed.'=>'Wannan na iya inganta maki gudunka a sabis kamar Pingdom, GTmetrix da PageSpeed.','Generate critical CSS through an online generation service and load the remaining CSS asynchronously.'=>'Ka samar da muhimmin CSS ta hanyar sabis na samar da intanet kuma ka lodi sauran CSS ɗin a jere daban.','Automatic generation of critical CSS is in the background via a cron-based queue.'=>'Ana samar da mahimman CSS ta atomatik a bango ta hanyar jerin gwano na cron.','When this option is turned %s, it will also load Google Fonts asynchronously.'=>'Lokacin da aka kunna wannan zaɓin %s, zai kuma loda Google Fonts ta hanyar da ba ta lokaci guda ba.','Elements with attribute %s in HTML code will be excluded.'=>'Za a cire abubuwan da ke da sifa %s a cikin lambar HTML.','This option is bypassed due to %s option.'=>'An wuce wannan zaɓi saboda zaɓin %s.','Disable this option to generate CCSS per Post Type instead of per page. This can save significant CCSS quota, however it may result in incorrect CSS styling if your site uses a page builder.'=>'Kashe wannan zaɓi domin samar da CCSS ta Nau\'in Sako maimakon kowane shafi. Wannan na iya adana babban adadin CCSS, sakamakon haka yana iya haifar da salon CSS da bai dace ba idan shafinka yana amfani da mai gina shafi (page builder).','This will inline the asynchronous CSS library to avoid render blocking.'=>'Wannan zai saka ɗakin karatu na CSS mai aiki a lokaci guda (asynchronous) a cikin shafin don guje wa hana buɗewar shafi (render blocking).','Default'=>'Na asali','Set this to append %1$s to all %2$s rules before caching CSS to specify how fonts should be displayed while being downloaded.'=>'Saita wannan domin ƙara %1$s a kan dukkan dokokin %2$s kafin adana CSS a madubin ajiyewa domin ƙayyade yadda ya kamata a nuna rubutu yayin da ake sauke shi.','%s is recommended.'=>'An ba da shawarar %s.','Swap'=>'Canza','Minify HTML content.'=>'Rage za abubuwan da ke cikin HTML.','Prefetching DNS can reduce latency for visitors.'=>'Samun DNS gaba zai iya rage jinkiri ga baƙi.','For example'=>'Misali misali','Automatically enable DNS prefetching for all URLs in the document, including images, CSS, JavaScript, and so forth.'=>'Ba da umarni ta atomatik don samun DNS gaba ga duk URLs da ke cikin takarda, harda hotuna, CSS, JavaScript, da sauransu.','This can improve the page loading speed.'=>'Wannan na iya inganta saurin loda shafin.','Preconnecting speeds up future loads from a given origin.'=>'Haɗa gaba yana saurin gaba da kaya daga wani asali.','Delay rendering off-screen HTML elements by its selector.'=>'Jinkirin fassarar abubuwan HTML na waje ta hanyar mai zaɓinsu (selector).','When minifying HTML do not discard comments that match a specified pattern.'=>'Lokacin da ake rage girman HTML kada a cire sharhin da ya dace da wani tsari da aka ƙayyade.','If comment to be kept is like: %1$s write: %2$s'=>'Idan sharhi da za a adana ya zama kamar: %1$s rubuta: %2$s','Remove query strings from internal static resources.'=>'Cire bayanan tambaya daga albarkatun cikin gida na statik.','Google reCAPTCHA will be bypassed automatically.'=>'Za a ketare Google reCAPTCHA ta atomatik.','Append query string %s to the resources to bypass this action.'=>'Shaƙe tambayar da ke cikin tsarin %s ga albarkatun don wuce wannan matakin.','Use Web Font Loader library to load Google Fonts asynchronously while leaving other CSS intact.'=>'Yi amfani da laburare na Web Font Loader don loda Google Fonts ta hanyar asynchronous yayin barin sauran CSS ba tare da an taba su ba.','This will also add a preconnect to Google Fonts to establish a connection earlier.'=>'Wannan kuma zai ƙara alaƙar farko zuwa Google Fonts don kafa alaƙa a baya.','Prevent Google Fonts from loading on all pages.'=>'Hana Google Fonts daga lodawa a duk shafuka.','Stop loading WordPress.org emoji. Browser default emoji will be displayed instead.'=>'Daina loda emoji na WordPress.org. Za a nuna emoji na tsohuwa ta burauza a maimakon haka.','This option will remove all %s tags from HTML.'=>'Wannan zabin zai cire duk alamomin %s daga HTML.','Minify JS files and inline JS codes.'=>'Takaita fayilolin JS da kuma sanya lambobin JS a ciki.','Combine all local JS files into a single file.'=>'Haɗa duk fayilolin JS na gida zuwa fayil ɗaya guda ɗaya.','This option may result in a JS error or layout issue on frontend pages with certain themes/plugins.'=>'Wannan zaɓin na iya haifar da kuskuren JS ko matsala ta tsari a shafukan gaba tare da wasu jigo/kari.','JS error can be found from the developer console of browser by right clicking and choosing Inspect.'=>'Ana iya samun kuskuren JS daga na\'urar bincike ta mai haɓakawa ta hanyar danna dama sannan a zaɓi Dubawa.','Include external JS and inline JS in combined file when %1$s is also enabled. This option helps maintain the priorities of JS execution, which should minimize potential errors caused by JS Combine.'=>'Hada bayanan JS na waje da na cikin layi a fayil guda idan an kuma kunna %1$s. Wannan zaɓin yana taimakawa wajen riƙe fifikon aiwatar da JS, wanda ya kamata ya rage kuskuren da ka iya faruwa sakamakon haɗa JS (JS Combine).','Deferred'=>'An dakatar','Delayed'=>'An jinkirta','Deferring until page is parsed or delaying till interaction can help reduce resource contention and improve performance causing a lower FID (Core Web Vitals metric).'=>'Jinkirtawa har sai an loda shafin ko jinkirtawa har zuwa lokacin da za a yi hulɗa na iya taimakawa wajen rage gasar albarkatu da inganta aiki wanda ke haifar da ƙananan FID (ma\'aunin Core Web Vitals).','Failed to create Avatar table. Please follow <a %s>Table Creation guidance from LiteSpeed Wiki</a> to finish setup.'=>'An kasa ƙirƙirar teburin Avatar. Don Allah a bi <a %s>Jagorar Ƙirƙirar Tebur daga LiteSpeed Wiki</a> don kammala saiti.','Localization Settings'=>'Saitunan Harshe','Store Gravatar locally.'=>'Ajiye Gravatar a cikin gida.','Accelerates the speed by caching Gravatar (Globally Recognized Avatars).'=>'Yana ƙara saurin lodi ta hanyar adana Gravatar (Globally Recognized Avatars) a cikin ma\'ajiyar wucin gadi (caching).','Refresh Gravatar cache by cron.'=>'Sabunta ma\'ajiyar Gravatar ta hanyar cron.','Avatar list in queue waiting for update'=>'Jerin avatar a cikin layin jiran sabuntawa','Run Queue Manually'=>'Gudanar da Jerin Ayyuka Da Kansa','Specify how long, in seconds, Gravatar files are cached.'=>'A ƙayyade tsawon lokacin, a cikin daƙiƙa, da aka adana fayilolin Gravatar.','Localize external resources.'=>'Sanya albarkatun waje a harshen yankin.','Please thoroughly test all items in %s to ensure they function as expected.'=>'Da fatan za a gwada duk abubuwan da ke cikin %s sosai don tabbatar da cewa suna aiki yadda ake tsammani.','Resources listed here will be copied and replaced with local URLs.'=>'Abubuwan da aka lissafa a nan za a kofe su kuma a Maye gurbinsu da adireshin URL na gida.','HTTPS sources only.'=>'Madogarar HTTPS kawai.','Comments are supported. Start a line with a %s to turn it into a comment line.'=>'Ana goyon bayan sharhi. Fara layin da %s don juya shi zuwa layin sharhi.','Example'=>'Misali','Please thoroughly test each JS file you add to ensure it functions as expected.'=>'Da fatan za a gwada kowane fayil na JS da kuka ƙara sosai don tabbatar da cewa yana aiki yadda ake tsammani.','Load images only when they enter the viewport.'=>'Sanya hotuna kawai lokacin da suka shiga yankin gani.','This can improve page loading time by reducing initial HTTP requests.'=>'Wannan na iya inganta saurin buɗe shafi ta hanyar rage buƙatun HTTP na farko.','Adding Style to Your Lazy-Loaded Images'=>'Ƙara Salo ga Hotunan da Ke Lodi a Gwargwado','Specify a base64 image to be used as a simple placeholder while images finish loading.'=>'Ƙayyade hoton base64 da za a yi amfani da shi azaman mai riƙe wuri mai sauƙi yayin da hotuna ke ƙare lodawa.','This can be predefined in %2$s as well using constant %1$s, with this setting taking priority.'=>'Ana iya saita wannan a cikin %2$s ta amfani da ma\'ana %1$s, tare da wannan saitin yana da fifiko.','By default a gray image placeholder %s will be used.'=>'Ta tsohuwar akidar za a yi amfani da gurbin hoto mai launin toka %s.','For example, %s can be used for a transparent placeholder.'=>'Misali, ana iya amfani da %s don wani wuri mara tushe mai nuna gaskiya.','Responsive image placeholders can help to reduce layout reshuffle when images are loaded.'=>'Wური wuraren hoto masu amsawa na iya taimakawa wajen rage sauyin shimfidawa yayin da ake loda hotuna.','This will generate the placeholder with same dimensions as the image if it has the width and height attributes.'=>'Wannan zai samar da wurin ajiye wuri mai girma ɗaya da na hoton idan yana da siffofin faɗi da tsayi.','Specify an SVG to be used as a placeholder when generating locally.'=>'Yi bayanin wani SVG da za a yi amfani da shi a matsayin madadin lokacin da ake samar da shi a gida.','It will be converted to a base64 SVG placeholder on-the-fly.'=>'Za a Mayar da shi zuwa wurin ajiye SVG na base64 a nan take.','Variables %s will be replaced with the corresponding image properties.'=>'Za a maye gurbin masu sauyawa %s da dukiyar hoton da ta dace.','Variables %s will be replaced with the configured background color.'=>'Za a maye gurbin masu sauyawa %s da launi na bangon da aka saita.','Specify the responsive placeholder SVG color.'=>'Bayyana launi na filin ajiyar SVG mai dacewa da girman allo.','Generate Low Quality Image Placeholders through an online generation service, for responsive image previews while loading.'=>'Hada Guraren Hoto Masu Inganci na Ƙasa ta hanyar sabis na samarwa ta Intanet, domin rigakafin samfotin hoto mai saurin amsawa yayin lodi.','Keep this off to use plain color placeholders.'=>'Ajiye wannan a kashe don amfani da launuka masu sauƙi a matsayin wuri.','Specify the quality when generating LQIP.'=>'Kayyade inganci yayin samar da LQIP.','Larger number will generate higher resolution quality placeholder, but will result in larger files which will increase page size and consume more points.'=>'Babban lamba zai samar da ingantaccen wuri mafi girma, amma zai haifar da manyan fayiloli waɗanda za su ƙara girman shafi kuma su cinye ƙarin maki.','Changes to this setting do not apply to already-generated LQIPs. To regenerate existing LQIPs, please %s first from the admin bar menu.'=>'Canje-canje ga wannan saitin ba sa aiki ga LQIPs da aka riga aka samar. Don sake samar da LQIPs da ke akwai, da fatan za a fara %s daga menu na mashigin gudanarwa.','pixels'=>'pixels','LQIP requests will not be sent for images where both width and height are smaller than these dimensions.'=>'Ba za a aika da buƙatun LQIP na hotunan da faɗinsu da tsayinsu duka suka yi ƙasa da waɗannan girmofi ba.','Automatically generate LQIP in the background via a cron-based queue.'=>'A haifar da LQIP ta atomatik a bango ta hanyar tsarin jerin gwano na cron.','If set to %1$s, before the placeholder is localized, the %2$s configuration will be used.'=>'Idan an saita zuwa %1$s, kafin a fassara wuri, za a yi amfani da tsarin %2$s.','If set to %s this is done in the foreground, which may slow down page load.'=>'Idan an saita zuwa %s ana yin wannan a gaban gida, wanda zai iya rage saurin lodi shafi.','Size list in queue waiting for cron'=>'Girman jerin a cikin layin jiran aiki don cron','Load iframes only when they enter the viewport.'=>'Load iframes kawai idan sun shiga wurin kallon allo.','Set an explicit width and height on image elements to reduce layout shifts and improve CLS (a Core Web Vitals metric).'=>'Saita fadi da tsayi na musamman a kan abubuwan hotuna don rage sauyin shimfidar wuri da inganta CLS (ma\'aunin Core Web Vitals).','Use %1$s to bypass remote image dimension check when %2$s is ON.'=>'Yi amfani da %1$s don wuce binciken girman hoton nesa lokacin da %2$s ke KUNNE.','The image compression quality setting of WordPress out of 100.'=>'Saitunan ingancin matse hotuna na WordPress daga cikin 100.','Automatically replace large images with scaled versions.'=>'Maye gurbin many hotuna ta atomatik tare da ingantattun sigogi.','Scaled size threshold'=>'Matsakaicin iyakar girmewa','Filter %s available to change threshold.'=>'An tace %s da ake da shi don canza ƙofa.','Listed images will not be lazy loaded.'=>'Ba za a ɗora hotunan da aka jera ta hanyar lazy load ba.','Useful for above-the-fold images causing CLS (a Core Web Vitals metric).'=>'Wannan yana da amfani ga hotunan da ke sama da nuni wadanda ke haifar da CLS (ma\'aunin Core Web Vitals).','Elements with attribute %s in html code will be excluded.'=>'Abubuwan da ke da sifa %s a cikin lambar html za a cire su.','Images containing these class names will not be lazy loaded.'=>'Hotunan da ke dauke da waɗannan sunayen aji ba za a yi musu lodin rago ba.','Images having these parent class names will not be lazy loaded.'=>'Hotunan da ke da waɗannan sunayen ajin iyaye ba za a yi musu lodi na rago ba.','Iframes containing these class names will not be lazy loaded.'=>'Ba za a loda Iframes da ke dauke da waɗannan sunayen aji ba da tallauci.','Iframes having these parent class names will not be lazy loaded.'=>'Ba za a loda iframes da ke da waɗannan sunayen aji na iyaye (parent class names) cikin kasala ba.','Prevent any lazy load of listed pages.'=>'Hanƙara kowane lodin rago na shafukan da aka lissafa.','These images will not generate LQIP.'=>'Ba za a samar da LQIP ga waɗannan hotunan ba.','Tuning Settings'=>'Saitunan Gyara Salo','Listed JS files or inline JS code will be delayed.'=>'Za a jinkirta fayilolin JS da aka lissafa ko lambar JS ta gida.','Listed JS files or inline JS code will not be minified or combined.'=>'Ba za a taƙaita ko a haɗa fayilolin JS da aka jera ko lambar JS ta cikin layi ba.','Predefined list will also be combined with the above settings.'=>'Za a haɗa bayanan da aka riga aka tsara tare da saitunan da ke sama.','Listed JS files or inline JS code will not be deferred or delayed.'=>'Ba za a jinkirta ko tsayar da fayilolin JS da aka lissafa ko lambar JS ta cikin layi ba.','Listed JS files or inline JS code will not be optimized by %s.'=>'Ba za a inganta fayilolin JS da aka jera ko lambar JS ta gida ta %s ba.','Prevent any optimization of listed pages.'=>'Ka hana duk wani inganta shafukan da aka lissafa.','Only optimize pages for guest (not logged in) visitors. If turned this OFF, CSS/JS/CCSS files will be doubled by each user group.'=>'Yi ingantawa kawai ga shafuka na baƙi (waɗanda ba su shiga ba). Idan aka kashe wannan, za a ninka fayilolin CSS/JS/CCSS sau biyu ta kowane rukuni na masu amfani.','Selected roles will be excluded from all optimizations.'=>'Za a cire matsayin da aka zaɓa daga duk wani gyare-gyare.','Tuning CSS Settings'=>'Gyara Saitunan CSS','Listed CSS files or inline CSS code will not be minified or combined.'=>'Ba za a taƙaita ko haɗa fayilolin CSS da aka lissafa ko lambar CSS ta cikin layi ba.','Predefined list will also be combined with the above settings'=>'Za a kuma haɗa jerin da aka riga aka tsara tare da saitunan da ke sama','Listed CSS files will be excluded from UCSS and saved to inline.'=>'Za a cire fayilolin CSS da aka lissafa daga UCSS kuma a adana su a cikin layi.','List the CSS selectors whose styles should always be included in UCSS.'=>'Jer لیست zaɓaɓɓun CSS waɗanda ya kamata a haɗa salon su koyaushe a cikin UCSS.','Learn more'=>'Kara koyo','Wildcard %s supported.'=>'Ana goyon bayan Wildcard %s.','The selector must exist in the CSS. Parent classes in the HTML will not work.'=>'Dole mai zaɓar ya kasance a cikin CSS. Ajujuwan iyaye a cikin HTML ba za su yi aiki ba.','Listed URI will not generate UCSS.'=>'Ba za a samar da UCSS ga URI da aka lissafa ba.','Use %1$s to generate one single UCSS for the pages which page type is %2$s while other page types still per URL.'=>'Yi amfani da %1$s don samar da UCSS guda daya ga shafukan da nau\'insu ke da %2$s yayin da sauran nau\'ikan shafukan ke ci gaba da kasancewa a kowane URL.','Use %1$s to bypass UCSS for the pages which page type is %2$s.'=>'Yi amfani da %1$s don wuce UCSS don shafukan da nau\'in shafinsu %2$s ne.','List post types where each item of that type should have its own CCSS generated.'=>'Yi lissafin nau\'ikan rubuce-rubuce inda ya kamata kowane abu na wancan nau\'in ya sami nasa CCSS da aka samar.','For example, if every Page on the site has different formatting, enter %s in the box. Separate critical CSS files will be stored for every Page on the site.'=>'Misali, idan kowane Shafi a shafin yana da tsari daban-daban, shigar da %s a cikin akwatin. Za a adana fayilolin CSS masu mahimmanci daban-daban don kowane Shafi a shafin.','Separate critical CSS files will be generated for paths containing these strings.'=>'Za a samar da fayilolin CSS masu mahimmanci daban-daban don hanyoyin da ke ƙunshe da waɗannan kirtani.','List the CSS selectors whose styles should always be included in CCSS.'=>'Lissafi masu zaɓin CSS waɗanda ya kamata a haɗa salon su koyaushe a cikin CCSS.','Selectors must exist in the CSS. Parent classes in the HTML will not work.'=>'Dole ne zaɓaɓɓu (selectors) su kasance a cikin CSS. Azuzuwan iyaye (parent classes) a cikin HTML ba za su yi aiki ba.','Specify critical CSS rules for above-the-fold content when enabling %s.'=>'Ƙayyadaddun ƙa\'idodin CSS masu mahimmanci don abubuwan da ke bayyane kafin gungurawa yayin kunna %s.','When you use Lazy Load, it will delay the loading of all images on a page.'=>'Lokacin da kuka yi amfani da Lazy Load, zai jinkirta sauke duk hotunan da ke shafi.','The Viewport Images service detects which images appear above the fold, and excludes them from lazy load.'=>'Aikin Viewport Images yana gano hotunan da suka bayyana a saman shafin, kuma yana cire su daga lodi mai jinkiri (lazy load).','This enables the page\'s initial screenful of imagery to be fully displayed without delay.'=>'Wannan yana ba da damar a nuna hotunan farko na shafin gaba ɗaya ba tare da jinkiri ba.','Enable Viewport Images auto generation cron.'=>'Kunna samar da hotunan gani ta atomatik ta hanyar cron.','Standard Presets'=>'Standard Presets','Import / Export'=>'Shigo da / Fitar da','Zinn® Cache Engine Configuration Presets'=>'Kyautata Saitunan Injiniya na Zinn® Cache','Essentials'=>'Muhimman Abubuwa','Default Cache'=>'Tsohuwar Ma\'ajiyar Farko','Higher TTL'=>'Mafi girman TTL','This no-risk preset is appropriate for all websites. Good for new users, simple websites, or cache-oriented development.'=>'Wannan tsarin da babu haɗari ya dace da duk gidajen yanar gizo. Yana da kyau ga sabbin masu amfani, sauƙaƙan gidajen yanar gizo, ko ci gaba da ke mai da hankali kan cache.','Only basic caching features are enabled. Every option in this preset works without any online service.'=>'Abubuwan tanadin cache na asali ne kawai aka kunna. Kowane zaɓi a cikin wannan saitin yana aiki ba tare da wani sabis na kan intanet ba.','Basic'=>'Na asali','Everything in Essentials, Plus'=>'Komai a cikin Essentials, da kuma Plus','Mobile Cache'=>'Ajiyar Wucin-gadi ta Wayar Hannu','This low-risk preset introduces basic optimizations for speed and user experience. Appropriate for enthusiastic beginners.'=>'Wannan tsari mai ƙarancin haɗari yana gabatar da ingantattun matakai na asali don saurin gudu da ƙwarewar mai amfani. Ya dace da sabbin masu sha\'awa.','Includes optimizations known to improve site score in page speed measurement tools. Some of them need an online generation service, which is not included in this plugin, and those have no effect.'=>'Ya haɗa da ingantawa waɗanda aka sani suna inganta maki shafi a cikin kayan aikin awo na saurin shafi. Wasu daga cikinsu suna buƙatar sabis na tsarawa ta intanet, wanda ba a haɗa shi da wannan ɗan amfani ba, kuma waɗancan ba su da wani tasiri.','Advanced (Recommended)'=>'Ci gaba (An ba da shawarar)','Everything in Basic, Plus'=>'Komai a cikin Basic, Plus','Guest Mode and Guest Optimization'=>'Yanayin Baƙo da Inganta Baƙo','CSS, JS and HTML Minification'=>'Ragewar CSS, JS da HTML','JS Defer for both external and inline JS'=>'JS Defer ga duka na waje da na ciki JS','DNS Prefetch for static files'=>'DNS Prefetch don fayiloli na zahiri','Remove Query Strings from Static Files'=>'Cire Maɓallin Tambaya daga Fayiloli Masu Tsaye','This preset is good for most websites, and is unlikely to cause conflicts. Any CSS or JS conflicts may be resolved with Page Optimization > Tuning tools.'=>'Wannan jeri na farko yana da kyau ga yawancin shafukan yanar gizo, kuma babu yuwuwar ya haifar da sabani. Duk wani sabani na CSS ko JS ana iya magance shi ta amfani da kayan aikin Page Optimization > Tuning.','Includes many optimizations known to improve page speed scores. Some of them need an online generation service, which is not included in this plugin, and those have no effect.'=>'Ya ƙunshi inganta abubuwa da yawa da aka sani suna inganta maki saurin shafi. Wasu daga cikinsu suna buƙatar sabis na tsarawa ta intanet, wanda ba a haɗa shi cikin wannan plugin ba, kuma waɗancan ba su da wani tasiri.','Aggressive'=>'Tsauri','Everything in Advanced, Plus'=>'Komai a cikin Advanced, Plus','CSS & JS Combine'=>'Haɗa CSS da JS','Asynchronous CSS Loading with Critical CSS'=>'Lodi na Asynchronous CSS tare da Critical CSS','Removed Unused CSS for Users'=>'An cire CSS da ba a amfani da shi ga masu amfani','Lazy Load for Iframes'=>'Lazy Load don Iframes','This preset might work out of the box for some websites, but be sure to test! Some CSS or JS exclusions may be necessary in Page Optimization > Tuning.'=>'Wannan tsari na iya yin aiki ba tare da wani gyara ba ga wasu shafukan yanar gizo, amma tabbatar da gwadawa! Wasu warewar CSS ko JS na iya zama dole a cikin Page Optimization > Tuning.','Extreme'=>'Tsakiya','Everything in Aggressive, Plus'=>'Komai na cikin Wuce gona da iri, Ƙari','Lazy Load for Images'=>'Lazy Load na Hotuna','Viewport Image Generation'=>'Samar da Hoton Viewport','JS Delayed'=>'An jinkirta JS','Inline JS added to Combine'=>'An shigar da JS a cikin Combine','Inline CSS added to Combine'=>'An saka CSS mai ɗaurewa a cikin Combine','This preset almost certainly will require testing and exclusions for some CSS, JS and Lazy Loaded images. Pay special attention to logos, or HTML-based slider images.'=>'Wannan shiri da aka riga aka tsara tabbas zai buƙaci gwaji da keɓancewa ga wasu CSS, JS da hotunan da ake ɗorawa a hankali (Lazy Loaded). Ku ba da kulawa ta musamman ga tambura, ko hotunan da ke kan madauwari (slider) masu tushen HTML.','Enables the maximum level of optimizations for improved page speed scores. Some of them need an online generation service, which is not included in this plugin, and those have no effect.'=>'Yana ba da damar mafi girman matakin haɓakawa don ingantaccen maki saurin shafi. Wasu daga cikinsu suna buƙatar sabis na ƙarni na kan layi, wanda ba a haɗa shi cikin wannan ɗigon ba, kuma waɗancan ba su da wani tasiri.','Zinn® Cache Engine Standard Presets'=>'Matsayin Ma\'ajiyar Cache na Zinn® Standard Presets','Use an official LiteSpeed-designed Preset to configure your site in one click. Try no-risk caching essentials, extreme optimization, or something in between.'=>'Yi amfani da wani Preset na hukuma da aka tsara ta LiteSpeed don saita shafin yanar gizon ku a cikin dannawa ɗaya. Gwada abubuwa masu mahimmanci na caching mara haɗari, matsananciyar haɓakawa, ko wani abu a tsakani.','Who should use this preset?'=>'Wane ne ya kamata ya yi amfani da wannan saitin?','This will back up your current settings and replace them with the %1$s preset settings. Do you want to continue?'=>'Wannan zai adana saitunan ku na yanzu kuma ya Maye gurbin su da saitunan %1$s. Kuna so ku ci gaba?','Apply Preset'=>'Afa Tabbatarwa','unknown'=>'mar Mara sani','History'=>'Tarihi','Error: Failed to apply the settings %1$s'=>'Kuskure: An kasa amfani da saitunan %1$s','Restored backup settings %1$s'=>'An dawo da tsoffin saitunan ajiyar bayanai %1$s','Applied the %1$s preset %2$s'=>'An yi amfani da tsarin %1$s %2$s','Backup created %1$s before applying the %2$s preset'=>'An haifar da ajiyar bayanai %1$s kafin a yi amfani da %2$s preset','This will restore the backup settings created %1$s before applying the %2$s preset. Any changes made since then will be lost. Do you want to continue?'=>'Wannan zai dawo da saitunan madadin da aka kirkira %1$s kafin amfani da tsarin %2$s. Duk wani canjin da aka yi tun lokacin zai ɓace. Kuna so ku ci gaba?','Restore Settings'=>'Maido da Saituna','Zinn® Cache Engine View .htaccess'=>'Zinn® Cache Engine Duba .htaccess','.htaccess Path'=>'Hanyar .htaccess','Frontend .htaccess Path'=>'Hanyar .htaccess ta Frontend','Default path is'=>'Hanyar asali ita ce','PHP Constant %s is supported.'=>'Ana goyon bayan PHP Constant %s.','You can use this code %1$s in %2$s to specify the htaccess file path.'=>'Kuna iya amfani da wannan lambar %1$s a cikin %2$s don ƙayyade hanyar fayil ɗin htaccess.','Backend .htaccess Path'=>'Hanyar Backend .htaccess','Current %s Contents'=>'Abubuwan da ke ciki na yanzu %s','View .htaccess'=>'Duba .htaccess','Heartbeat'=>'Bugun zuciya','Debug Settings'=>'Saitunan Cire Kuskure','Log View'=>'Duban Rajoji','Zinn® Cache Engine Toolbox'=>'Akwatin kayan aiki na Zinn® Cache Engine','Heartbeat Control'=>'Kulawar Bugun Zuciya','Disable WordPress interval heartbeat to reduce server load.'=>'Kashe bugun zuciya na lokaci-lokaci na WordPress don rage nauyin uwar garken.','Disabling this may cause WordPress tasks triggered by AJAX to stop working.'=>'Kashe wannan na iya sa ayyukan WordPress da AJAX ke haifarwa su daina aiki.','Turn ON to control heartbeat on frontend.'=>'Kunna don sarrafa bugun zuciya a kan gaba.','Specify the %s heartbeat interval in seconds.'=>'Sanya tazarar bugun zuciya na %s a cikin daƙiƙa.','WordPress valid interval is %s seconds.'=>'Lokacin inganci na WordPress shine daƙiƙa %s.','Set to %1$s to forbid heartbeat on %2$s.'=>'Sanya zuwa %1$s don hana bugun zuciya a kan %2$s.','Turn ON to control heartbeat on backend.'=>'Kunna don sarrafa bugun zuciya a kan backend.','Turn ON to control heartbeat in backend editor.'=>'Kunna don sarrafa bugun zuciya a cikin editan baya.','Export Settings'=>'Fitilar Saituna','Export'=>'Fitowa da shi','Last exported'=>'An fitar da shi karshe','This will export all current Zinn® Cache Engine settings and save them as a file.'=>'Wannan zai fitar da duk abubuwan da aka tsara na Zinn® Cache Engine na yanzu kuma ya adana su a matsayin fayil.','Import Settings'=>'Shigo da Saituna','Import'=>'Shigo da shi','Last imported'=>'An shigo da shi karshe','This will import settings from a file and override all current Zinn® Cache Engine settings.'=>'Wannan zai shigo da saituna daga fayil kuma ya soke duk saitunan Zinn® Cache Engine na yanzu.','Reset All Settings'=>'Sake saita Duk Saituna','This will reset all settings to default settings.'=>'Wannan zai dawo da duk saitunan zuwa saitunan farko.','Are you sure you want to reset all settings back to the default settings?'=>'Shin ka tabbata kana son sake saita duk saitunan zuwa saitunan tsohuwa?','Reset Settings'=>'Sake saita Saituna','Purge Log'=>'Share Log din','Crawler Log'=>'Log din mai shigowa','LiteSpeed Logs'=>'Kundin adana bayanan LiteSpeed','Clear Logs'=>'Goge Rajabun Bayanai','Click to copy'=>'Danna don kwafi','Copy Log'=>'Kwafi Log','Click to download'=>'Danna don saukewa','Download'=>'Sauke','Purge Front Page'=>'Wanke Shafin Farko','This will Purge Front Page only'=>'Wannan zai share Babban Shafin kawai','Purge Pages'=>'Goge Shafuka','This will Purge Pages only'=>'Wannan zai share Shafuka kawai','Purge %s Error'=>'Share Kuskuren %s','Purge %s error pages'=>'Goge shafukan kuskure na %s','Purge the LiteSpeed cache entries created by this plugin'=>'Share abubuwan da aka adana na gida na LiteSpeed da wannan plugin din ya kirkira','This will purge all minified/combined CSS/JS entries only'=>'Wannan zai share duk ãyoyin CSS/JS ɗin da aka taƙaita/haɗe kaɗai','Purge all the object caches'=>'Share duk wani ajiyar abu da aka riga aka yi','Reset the entire opcode cache'=>'Sake saita gaba daya wurin ajiye bayanai na opcode','Critical CSS'=>'Mahimmin CSS','This will delete all generated critical CSS files'=>'Wannan zai goge duk fayilolin CSS masu muhimmanci da aka samar','Unique CSS'=>'Keɓaɓɓen CSS','This will delete all generated unique CSS files'=>'Wannan zai goge duk fayilolin CSS na musamman da aka kirkira','This will delete all localized resources'=>'Wannan zai share dukiyoyin da aka fassara','This will delete all generated image LQIP placeholder files'=>'Wannan zai goge duk fayilolin wuri na LQIP masu hoton da aka ƙirƙira','This will delete all generated Viewport Images'=>'Wannan zai goge duk hotunan Viewport da aka samar','This will delete all cached Gravatar files'=>'Wannan zai goge duk fayilolin Gravatar da aka adana a wuri na ɗan lokaci','Purge the cache entries created by this plugin except for Critical CSS & Unique CSS & LQIP caches'=>'Goge abubuwan ajiyar cache da wannan plugin ya kirkira ban da ajiyar Critical CSS da Unique CSS da LQIP','Empty Entire Cache'=>'Koro Dukan Ma\'adanar Raba-gari','Clears all cache entries related to this site, including other web applications.'=>'Share duk abubuwan da ke cikin cache da suka shafi wannan shafin, har da sauran aikace-aikacen yanar gizo.','This action should only be used if things are cached incorrectly.'=>'Wannan matakin ya kamata a yi amfani da shi ne kawai idan an adana abubuwa a cikin cache ba daidai ba.','This will clear EVERYTHING inside the cache.'=>'Wannan zai share KOMAI da ke cikin cache.','This may cause heavy load on the server.'=>'Wannan na iya haifar da babban nauyi a kan uwar garken.','If only the WordPress site should be purged, use Purge All.'=>'Idan rukunin yanar gizon WordPress kawai ne ya kamata a tsaftace, yi amfani da Purge All.','Purge By...'=>'Sharewa Ta...','Select below for "Purge by" options.'=>'Zaɓi a ƙasa don zaɓuɓɓukan "Sharre ta".','Category'=>'Nau\'i','Post ID'=>'ID na Rubutu','Tag'=>'Lakabi','Purge pages by category name - e.g. %2$s should be used for the URL %1$s.'=>'Share shafuka ta sunan rukunin - misali ya kamata a yi amfani da %2$s don URL %1$s.','Purge pages by post ID.'=>'Share shafuka ta hanyar ID na post.','Purge pages by tag name - e.g. %2$s should be used for the URL %1$s.'=>'Share shafuka ta sunan tag - misali %2$s ya kamata a yi amfani da shi don URL %1$s.','Purge pages by relative or full URL.'=>'Share safunan ta hanyar amfani da cikakken URL ko wanda ke da alaƙa.','e.g. Use %1$s or %2$s.'=>'misali. Yi amfani da %1$s ko %2$s.','Purge List'=>'Sharefin Jerewa','Debug Helpers'=>'Taimakon Gyara Kuskure','View Site Before Optimization'=>'Duba Shafin Kafin Ingantawa','View Site Before Cache'=>'Kalli Shafin Kafin Cache','Disable All Features for 24 Hours'=>'Kashe Dukkan Abubuwan da Suke Aiki Na Tsawon Awanni 24','Remove `Disable All Feature` Flag Now'=>'Cire Tutar `Disable All Feature` Yanzu','Zinn® Cache Engine is temporarily disabled until: %s.'=>'An kashe Zinn® Cache Engine na wucin gadi har zuwa: %s.','This will disable LSCache and all optimization features for debug purpose.'=>'Wannan zai kashe LSCache da duk abubuwan haɓakawa don dalilan warware matsala.','Admin IP Only'=>'IP na Admin Kadai','Outputs to a series of files in the %s directory.'=>'Ana fitar da su zuwa jeri na fayiloli a cikin kundin adireshi na %s.','To prevent filling up the disk, this setting should be OFF when everything is working.'=>'Don hana cika faifan diski, ya kamata wannan saitin ya kasance a KASHE lokacin da komai yana aiki yadda ya kamata.','The Admin IP option will only output log messages on requests from admin IPs listed below.'=>'Zaɓin Admin IP zai fitar da saƙonni masu shiga ne kawai a kan buƙatun daga IPs na mai gudanarwa da aka lissafa a ƙasa.','Allows listed IPs (one per line) to perform certain actions from their browsers.'=>'Yana ba da damar IP-oyin da aka lissafa (ɗaya a kowane layi) don yin wasu ayyuka daga masu binciken yanar gizinsu.','Your IP'=>'IP ɗinka','More information about the available commands can be found here.'=>'Ana iya samun ƙarin bayani game da umarnin da ake da su a nan.','Advanced level will log more details.'=>'Matakin ci gaba zai rubuta ƙarin bayani a cikin rajista.','MB'=>'MB','Specify the maximum size of the log file.'=>'Saita iyakar girman fayil ɗin log.','Shorten query strings in the debug log to improve readability.'=>'Ragewa a cikin layin bincike na taron debug don inganta sauƙin karatu.','Only log listed pages.'=>'Yi rijistar shafukan da aka lissafa kawai.','Prevent any debug log of listed pages.'=>'Hanƙaita duk wani rajistar warware matsala na shafukan da aka lissafa.','Prevent writing log entries that include listed strings.'=>'Hanƙana rubuta bayanan log da suka ƙunshi kirtani da aka lissafa.','See the Zinn Digital® release notes.'=>'Duba bayanan fitarwa na Zinn Digital®.','The downloaded update failed its integrity check and was not installed.'=>'Sabuntawar da aka sauke ta gaza a wajen tantance amincinta kuma ba a shigar da ita ba.','%s — guides and services'=>'%s — jagorori da ayyuka','User guides'=>'Jagororin masu amfani','Read the %s user guide'=>'Karanta jagorar mai amfani ta %s','Hide this'=>'Boye da Wannan','Zinn® hosting for WordPress'=>'Zinn® hosting don WordPress','LiteSpeed, daily backups, free migration and a control panel built for people who run more than one site.'=>'LiteSpeed, madogaransa na kullum, ƙaura kyauta da kuma allon sarrafawa da aka gina don mutanen da ke gudanar da shafuka fiye da ɗaya.','The Zinn® marketplace'=>'Kasuwancin Zinn®','Buy and sell established sites, domains and link placements, with the money held safely until both sides are happy.'=>'Sayi da siyar da ingantattun shafuka, yankunan yanar gizo, da wuraren sanya hanyoyin sadarwa, tare da ajiyar kuɗi lafiya har sai ɓangarorin biyu sun gamsu.','Zinn Hub® — hire people who do this for a living'=>'Zinn Hub® — ka ɗauki ma\'aikatan da ke yin wannan a matsayin sana\'a','Our global freelance marketplace: browse over 10,000 ready-made services from writers, designers, developers and SEOs, or post a project and let them bid.'=>'Kasuwancinmu na masu zaman kansu na duniya: bincika ayyuka sama da 10,000 da aka riga aka shirya daga marubuta, masu zanen kaya, masu haɓakawa da ƙwararrun SEO, ko kuma sanya aikin kuma bari su yi gwanjo.']];